(966037, 114029, 25464, '<td valign="top">This could have worked if your background didn''t say Epson . . Epson . . Epson.  It is a good idea with poor execution.  I would suggest turning this shot portrait rather than landscape.  The focus is a bit soft on the tip which is the focal point.  Your focus seems to be clearest on the first ridge instead.  Keep trying.</td>', 'This could have worked if your background didn''t say Epson . . Epson . . Epson.  It is a good idea with poor execution.  I would suggest turning this shot portrait rather than landscape.  The focus is a bit soft on the tip which is the focal point.  Your focus seems to be clearest on the first ridge instead.  Keep trying.', '2004-10-20 01:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
