(966270, 114016, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait.  I think the composition is great.  In other challenges, the second child in the background might be distracting; however, it is not a distraction in the context of the School Days Challenge since you would expect to see more than one child.  I think the black and white is displayed perfectly.  Her hair fades into the background, but it draws your attention to the face and the great expression exhibited there.  I think this entry will place high. 9.</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait.  I think the composition is great.  In other challenges, the second child in the background might be distracting; however, it is not a distraction in the context of the School Days Challenge since you would expect to see more than one child.  I think the black and white is displayed perfectly.  Her hair fades into the background, but it draws your attention to the face and the great expression exhibited there.  I think this entry will place high. 9.', '2004-10-20 02:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
