(966337, 112614, 8635, '<td valign="top">I like the photograph -- technically, it''s a very good shot, though the lighting could''ve been improved to increase tonal variation.  As for the title, I find it rather depressing when contrasted with the image; because the image conjures bleakness, rigidity... things that I would never associate with a child''s mind.</td>', 'I like the photograph -- technically, it''s a very good shot, though the lighting could''ve been improved to increase tonal variation.  As for the title, I find it rather depressing when contrasted with the image; because the image conjures bleakness, rigidity... things that I would never associate with a child''s mind.', '2004-10-20 03:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(966338, 113978, 8759, '<td valign="top">Nice add pic</td>', 'Nice add pic', '2004-10-20 03:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(966353, 114161, 25203, '<td valign="top">I give you a ten for the idea.  Raising little killing machines, yup, that''s what school is for.  Today I rained very hard in northern california and I saw 34 flags flying in the down pore.  How sad.  People blindly follow the flag, but don''t even bring it in when it is raining.  I hope you will not vote with the flag waving party this november.</td>', 'I give you a ten for the idea.  Raising little killing machines, yup, that''s what school is for.  Today I rained very hard in northern california and I saw 34 flags flying in the down pore.  How sad.  People blindly follow the flag, but don''t even bring it in when it is raining.  I hope you will not vote with the flag waving party this november.', '2004-10-20 04:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
