(966856, 114221, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation!  Libraries are the only life-long learning institutions freely available to all.<br/> <br/>Like the choice of angle and the limited pallette.  Strong lines work well to make a pleasing composition.  Gotta love those old Carnegie buildings!</td>', 'Nice interpretation!  Libraries are the only life-long learning institutions freely available to all. Like the choice of angle and the limited pallette.  Strong lines work well to make a pleasing composition.  Gotta love those old Carnegie buildings!', '2004-10-20 13:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
