(967249, 114029, 1827, '<td valign="top">The perspective is intriguing and captures my interest, though I think I might prefer a 90 CCW rotate with the mouthpiece right there inviting me to practice.  I''m afraid I missed the Epson connection and feel that that entire portion detracts from the image.  I''d prefer it if the recorder wasn''t  flush against the edge of the sheet music, which would enacle you to use a black background.  I think that would work better as would a tighter crop on that portion on the image. 5, just-married</td>', 'The perspective is intriguing and captures my interest, though I think I might prefer a 90 CCW rotate with the mouthpiece right there inviting me to practice.  I''m afraid I missed the Epson connection and feel that that entire portion detracts from the image.  I''d prefer it if the recorder wasn''t  flush against the edge of the sheet music, which would enacle you to use a black background.  I think that would work better as would a tighter crop on that portion on the image. 5, just-married', '2004-10-20 17:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
