(967251, 113996, 26045, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to say about this one...I''m voting it low because it isn''t a very good photograph - it''s so neon! The object is not articulated. Is that a paddle? I''m guessing here... sorry!</td>', 'Not sure what to say about this one...I''m voting it low because it isn''t a very good photograph - it''s so neon! The object is not articulated. Is that a paddle? I''m guessing here... sorry!', '2004-10-20 17:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(967252, 114198, 24990, '<td valign="top">is it poisoned? the girl looks as if it could well be...</td>', 'is it poisoned? the girl looks as if it could well be...', '2004-10-20 17:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(967254, 114206, 1827, '<td valign="top">Though validated, this looks like something I could make from scratch in Photoshop, and as such holds non photographic appeal for me personally. 3, just-married</td>', 'Though validated, this looks like something I could make from scratch in Photoshop, and as such holds non photographic appeal for me personally. 3, just-married', '2004-10-20 17:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(967255, 114170, 24990, '<td valign="top">hey... come back... you left the camera on the floor....heheh</td>', 'hey... come back... you left the camera on the floor....heheh', '2004-10-20 17:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(967261, 113510, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this low for a few reasons... first and foremost, because it isn''t really in focus. Secondly, I personally don''t see how a senior football game is education. I get it, I mean I see how it can be associated with education, but I just won''t score it high for a challenge decidedly about education.</td>', 'I''m voting this low for a few reasons... first and foremost, because it isn''t really in focus. Secondly, I personally don''t see how a senior football game is education. I get it, I mean I see how it can be associated with education, but I just won''t score it high for a challenge decidedly about education.', '2004-10-20 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(967262, 113550, 24990, '<td valign="top">oi.... thats my wall.........</td>', 'oi.... thats my wall.........', '2004-10-20 17:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(967263, 113907, 19445, '<td valign="top">a tighter crop of the banners would have worked better - the hallway doesn''t add to the photo</td>', 'a tighter crop of the banners would have worked better - the hallway doesn''t add to the photo', '2004-10-20 17:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(967264, 112914, 1827, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had to rely on incandescent lighting here, which is causing the orange color cast.  Perhaps a different colored shirt could have made that feel less prominent (as it probably adss color reflection of the sirt as well).   Also would like focus a tad sharper.  5, just-married</td>', 'Looks like you had to rely on incandescent lighting here, which is causing the orange color cast.  Perhaps a different colored shirt could have made that feel less prominent (as it probably adss color reflection of the sirt as well).   Also would like focus a tad sharper.  5, just-married', '2004-10-20 17:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(967265, 114247, 26045, '<td valign="top">This is really freaking me out. I''m voting it low because it ain''t in focus and it just does not appeal to my understanding of education. I''m assuming this is all staged, but if it''s in a school...what''s the paddle doing there? Maybe I''m just naive, but...</td>', 'This is really freaking me out. I''m voting it low because it ain''t in focus and it just does not appeal to my understanding of education. I''m assuming this is all staged, but if it''s in a school...what''s the paddle doing there? Maybe I''m just naive, but...', '2004-10-20 17:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(967266, 114204, 24990, '<td valign="top">all in quite good condition too.... nice photo... hey I''m 25, I appreciate it...</td>', 'all in quite good condition too.... nice photo... hey I''m 25, I appreciate it...', '2004-10-20 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
