(967270, 114034, 24990, '<td valign="top">slight graininess to the picture..... shame.... good idea tho, I would have liked the inkpot/pen a bit sharper...</td>', 'slight graininess to the picture..... shame.... good idea tho, I would have liked the inkpot/pen a bit sharper...', '2004-10-20 17:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(967271, 113879, 26045, '<td valign="top">Is this a schoolhouse? I wouldn''t know from just looking at the window. Looks like it could be your neighbor''s house, or my neighbor''s house... I''m voting it low because it just doesn''t appeal to my understanding of education, and because the photo itself is not very interesting, maybe because of the electrical box and grafitti on the shutter.</td>', 'Is this a schoolhouse? I wouldn''t know from just looking at the window. Looks like it could be your neighbor''s house, or my neighbor''s house... I''m voting it low because it just doesn''t appeal to my understanding of education, and because the photo itself is not very interesting, maybe because of the electrical box and grafitti on the shutter.', '2004-10-20 17:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(967272, 114244, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the element of the compass, but maybe it would have been better laying down.  It kind of bothers me that there is a partial arc but the point is not centered in the radius ( is the point even touching the paper?)  But still, there are strong elements here and I am giving it a 7.</td>', 'I like the element of the compass, but maybe it would have been better laying down.  It kind of bothers me that there is a partial arc but the point is not centered in the radius ( is the point even touching the paper?)  But still, there are strong elements here and I am giving it a 7.', '2004-10-20 17:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(967273, 114249, 1827, '<td valign="top">A bit of compression artifacts  showing on the paper, but the composition is quite good.  Still, even with the thought and care placed on framing the subject, you''re right.  It''s just boring. may bump to a 6 later.  5, just-married</td>', 'A bit of compression artifacts  showing on the paper, but the composition is quite good.  Still, even with the thought and care placed on framing the subject, you''re right.  It''s just boring. may bump to a 6 later.  5, just-married', '2004-10-20 17:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(967275, 114050, 26475, '<td valign="top">with this point of view, and the fact that the guy is blurry while the books are in sharp relief make me feel as if the books are falling on top of him. Took me quite a while to realize he''s asleep on the desk. Try putting him as the focal point and not the books</td>', 'with this point of view, and the fact that the guy is blurry while the books are in sharp relief make me feel as if the books are falling on top of him. Took me quite a while to realize he''s asleep on the desk. Try putting him as the focal point and not the books', '2004-10-20 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(967276, 114024, 24990, '<td valign="top">the flash really spoils this shot.....</td>', 'the flash really spoils this shot.....', '2004-10-20 17:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(967277, 112845, 26045, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this low because it''s a completely uninspired photograph, with no real focal point, no contrast, and no imagination. Sorry to sound harsh! Regardless of me, good luck!</td>', 'I''m voting this low because it''s a completely uninspired photograph, with no real focal point, no contrast, and no imagination. Sorry to sound harsh! Regardless of me, good luck!', '2004-10-20 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(967278, 114198, 18799, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice, but I don''t care for your choice of lighting direction or strength - it''s a little dramatic.  That is unless this is a poison apple....</td>', 'The composition is nice, but I don''t care for your choice of lighting direction or strength - it''s a little dramatic.  That is unless this is a poison apple....', '2004-10-20 17:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
