(967285, 114191, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very very good idea, but very very bad lighting. Maybe a tighter crop would help, get rid of that harsh shadow, the edge of what looks like a dinner plate, etc. Her expression is excellent, but the quality of the photo just doesn''t match the quality of the idea. I''m voting it low for those reasons mentioned, but wanted to say I really think this is an excellent idea, and model!</td>', 'Very very good idea, but very very bad lighting. Maybe a tighter crop would help, get rid of that harsh shadow, the edge of what looks like a dinner plate, etc. Her expression is excellent, but the quality of the photo just doesn''t match the quality of the idea. I''m voting it low for those reasons mentioned, but wanted to say I really think this is an excellent idea, and model!', '2004-10-20 17:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
