(967997, 113389, 28070, '<td valign="top">Nice. I love math. Stupid number coincidence, my clock says 11:44 and I look at the photo at the 144 on the calculator.  Some people would think superstition or something but numbers are set up to over lap themselves. It''s a cycle like everything else. Good photo setup.</td>', 'Nice. I love math. Stupid number coincidence, my clock says 11:44 and I look at the photo at the 144 on the calculator.  Some people would think superstition or something but numbers are set up to over lap themselves. It''s a cycle like everything else. Good photo setup.', '2004-10-21 03:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
