(968422, 114044, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract take on the challenge. Nice dramatic contrasts in light and dark and the various lines and shapes. I''m not nuts about the composition as a whole. I might have liked a more 3/4 view then this to create more diagonals and to take better advantage of the interesting shapes and shadows created by the indexes. The expanse of speckled white is less interesting to me but it takes up more of the frame.</td>', 'Interesting abstract take on the challenge. Nice dramatic contrasts in light and dark and the various lines and shapes. I''m not nuts about the composition as a whole. I might have liked a more 3/4 view then this to create more diagonals and to take better advantage of the interesting shapes and shadows created by the indexes. The expanse of speckled white is less interesting to me but it takes up more of the frame.', '2004-10-21 13:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(968423, 113126, 27375, '<td valign="top">the face of the subject looks sad instead of angry enough to break a PEN..thats not so easy.   anyways if the person looked angry, i think this would be much better. still a very good idea and picture quality is also as well.</td>', 'the face of the subject looks sad instead of angry enough to break a PEN..thats not so easy.   anyways if the person looked angry, i think this would be much better. still a very good idea and picture quality is also as well.', '2004-10-21 13:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(968426, 114170, 27375, '<td valign="top">oh what memories this brings, this looks almost exactly like my front yard as a child...very nice moment</td>', 'oh what memories this brings, this looks almost exactly like my front yard as a child...very nice moment', '2004-10-21 13:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(968430, 113593, 7322, '<td valign="top">On a technical level this is a decent photo. In terms of visual interest I find it very dull. I like school buses for their shape, nostalgia, and overall orangy-ness. There is potential for a great photo here but this is just too literal an interpretation. It doesn''t offer anything new to the viewer. Most of us have seen a school bus. The trick with photographing such familiar objects---particularly when there is no human element for the viewer to indentify with---is to show it in a way that provokes an emotional response of some kind. Nice effort.</td>', 'On a technical level this is a decent photo. In terms of visual interest I find it very dull. I like school buses for their shape, nostalgia, and overall orangy-ness. There is potential for a great photo here but this is just too literal an interpretation. It doesn''t offer anything new to the viewer. Most of us have seen a school bus. The trick with photographing such familiar objects---particularly when there is no human element for the viewer to indentify with---is to show it in a way that provokes an emotional response of some kind. Nice effort.', '2004-10-21 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(968431, 113070, 26189, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!!!!!!!  I love it!</td>', 'LOL!!!!!!!!!  I love it!', '2004-10-21 13:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(968436, 114029, 27524, '<td valign="top">Your idea with turning makes it more interesting. Still would like there would be more lights and shades... also backround preferably without titles.</td>', 'Your idea with turning makes it more interesting. Still would like there would be more lights and shades... also backround preferably without titles.', '2004-10-21 13:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(968437, 113006, 7322, '<td valign="top">An original take (I wish college costs in the US could be fiscally compared to 50 airline tickets!). The photo is a bit cluttered though. In my opinion, a few items would have made the statement and been less visually confusion. This kind of looks like the contents of a junk drawer to me.</td>', 'An original take (I wish college costs in the US could be fiscally compared to 50 airline tickets!). The photo is a bit cluttered though. In my opinion, a few items would have made the statement and been less visually confusion. This kind of looks like the contents of a junk drawer to me.', '2004-10-21 13:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(968438, 113710, 18403, '<td valign="top">But, in a few years these dudes will be working for the ''geeks'' at minimum wage!<br/>Nice shot and an unavoidable hazard of high school.  7</td>', 'But, in a few years these dudes will be working for the ''geeks'' at minimum wage!Nice shot and an unavoidable hazard of high school.  7', '2004-10-21 13:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(968440, 113400, 18403, '<td valign="top">My dog couldn''t read either. 6</td>', 'My dog couldn''t read either. 6', '2004-10-21 13:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
