(968475, 113232, 7322, '<td valign="top">I would enjoy this more if there were children playing in the school yard or some kind of old play equipment. The building itself is rather boring architecturally. It looks too newly renovated to really evoke nostalgia despite the use of grainy black and white. Without the title and the identifying sign this just appears to be a commonplace house. No complaints about the technical quality.</td>', 'I would enjoy this more if there were children playing in the school yard or some kind of old play equipment. The building itself is rather boring architecturally. It looks too newly renovated to really evoke nostalgia despite the use of grainy black and white. Without the title and the identifying sign this just appears to be a commonplace house. No complaints about the technical quality.', '2004-10-21 13:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(968476, 114094, 27482, '<td valign="top">I can´t really see how the cd player helps, but it´s a funny shot.  The lighting isn´t of very high quality either but I gave it an 6.</td>', 'I can´t really see how the cd player helps, but it´s a funny shot.  The lighting isn´t of very high quality either but I gave it an 6.', '2004-10-21 13:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(968477, 113763, 24925, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t look appealing to me in any way. I don''t like the wood grain and I''m not sure what this photograph is supposed to ''say''...</td>', 'This just doesn''t look appealing to me in any way. I don''t like the wood grain and I''m not sure what this photograph is supposed to ''say''...', '2004-10-21 13:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(968478, 113907, 19010, '<td valign="top">It just didn''t grab my attention. Good angles good lighting. I just couldn''t get exited.</td>', 'It just didn''t grab my attention. Good angles good lighting. I just couldn''t get exited.', '2004-10-21 13:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(968480, 113212, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice lights...from lighter to darker... also good compozition...small house on big field.</td>', 'Nice lights...from lighter to darker... also good compozition...small house on big field.', '2004-10-21 13:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(968481, 113710, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better if you had shot this at another time of day for the very bright backround draws way too much attention.  Also you can´t really make out the faces of the two boys in the back but perhaps you intended it that way.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better if you had shot this at another time of day for the very bright backround draws way too much attention.  Also you can´t really make out the faces of the two boys in the back but perhaps you intended it that way.', '2004-10-21 13:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(968482, 114123, 24925, '<td valign="top">I''m desperately trying to put 2 and 2 together here but I just can''t do it...A gun, a bible-related book and school days.  Maybe this is representing that the bible and guns should be kept out of schools?  If so, this photo is not effective in conveying that message...</td>', 'I''m desperately trying to put 2 and 2 together here but I just can''t do it...A gun, a bible-related book and school days.  Maybe this is representing that the bible and guns should be kept out of schools?  If so, this photo is not effective in conveying that message...', '2004-10-21 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(968483, 114043, 19010, '<td valign="top">just didn''t seem very creative.</td>', 'just didn''t seem very creative.', '2004-10-21 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(968484, 113834, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not very original, but other than that a great use of DOF.</td>', 'Not very original, but other than that a great use of DOF.', '2004-10-21 13:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(968485, 113919, 24925, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot of a man wearing a wig and holding a book...I don''t really understand the message of this photo and don''t find myself enjoying it a whole lot...</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot of a man wearing a wig and holding a book...I don''t really understand the message of this photo and don''t find myself enjoying it a whole lot...', '2004-10-21 13:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(968486, 114207, 19010, '<td valign="top">good but i think i would have like it better without the lanp and maybe a heavier sapia coloring.</td>', 'good but i think i would have like it better without the lanp and maybe a heavier sapia coloring.', '2004-10-21 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(968487, 114196, 24925, '<td valign="top">Cute girl with a nice expression...Without the grain, and zoomed in on just the girl and the doll this could have been a decent photo.  The way it is, there are just too many distracting elements which don''t need to be there...</td>', 'Cute girl with a nice expression...Without the grain, and zoomed in on just the girl and the doll this could have been a decent photo.  The way it is, there are just too many distracting elements which don''t need to be there...', '2004-10-21 13:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(968489, 114175, 24925, '<td valign="top">Both the sky and the hedge are distracting in this photo...the windows could have made an interesting pattern but the photo is taken too far away and contains too many other elements to be very effective.</td>', 'Both the sky and the hedge are distracting in this photo...the windows could have made an interesting pattern but the photo is taken too far away and contains too many other elements to be very effective.', '2004-10-21 13:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(968491, 113784, 24925, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do a lot for me...I have no idea what I should be looking at here and it doesn''t look like a lot of planning went into this shot.  What were the reasons you included the things in this photo that are there?  Why from this angle?  Why include the glare?  These are all questions that seem unanswered...</td>', 'This doesn''t do a lot for me...I have no idea what I should be looking at here and it doesn''t look like a lot of planning went into this shot.  What were the reasons you included the things in this photo that are there?  Why from this angle?  Why include the glare?  These are all questions that seem unanswered...', '2004-10-21 13:59:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(968492, 112985, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject and nice exposure. I don''t really care for this overhead point of view, however. It winds up looking too literal to me--as if the photographer came across the chair and just looked down and snapped the shot without really considering the best approach. The fact that it was shot at a bit of angle in the frame suggests otherwise to me. I think you did think it out and chose this POV for a reason. I''m just not in agreement with your choice. The angle adds a nice diagonal tension to the frame but it doesn''t make much sense to me in terms of the subject--an old, rusted and rotting school desk and chair suggests a ''quieter'' approach then the ''exciting'' visual tension that diagonals create.</td>', 'Good choice of subject and nice exposure. I don''t really care for this overhead point of view, however. It winds up looking too literal to me--as if the photographer came across the chair and just looked down and snapped the shot without really considering the best approach. The fact that it was shot at a bit of angle in the frame suggests otherwise to me. I think you did think it out and chose this POV for a reason. I''m just not in agreement with your choice. The angle adds a nice diagonal tension to the frame but it doesn''t make much sense to me in terms of the subject--an old, rusted and rotting school desk and chair suggests a ''quieter'' approach then the ''exciting'' visual tension that diagonals create.', '2004-10-21 13:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(968494, 113833, 19010, '<td valign="top">nice shot good lighting and subject matter. I think i would like to have seen it from a little more distance.</td>', 'nice shot good lighting and subject matter. I think i would like to have seen it from a little more distance.', '2004-10-21 13:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(968497, 114254, 7322, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract take on the challenge. I think the focus is a bit off (or else it is just extremely noisy) which really hurts an abstract photo, IMO.</td>', 'An interesting abstract take on the challenge. I think the focus is a bit off (or else it is just extremely noisy) which really hurts an abstract photo, IMO.', '2004-10-21 14:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(968498, 114236, 24925, '<td valign="top">Not too bad...decent idea.  The person closest to the camera is very distracting, though.  Without that, the blur would have looked neat with the sharp "Welcome back" sign.</td>', 'Not too bad...decent idea.  The person closest to the camera is very distracting, though.  Without that, the blur would have looked neat with the sharp "Welcome back" sign.', '2004-10-21 14:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(968499, 114039, 19010, '<td valign="top">No color, and to dark. I think with a little photoshop. this could easly be a great shot. possibly a ribbon contender.</td>', 'No color, and to dark. I think with a little photoshop. this could easly be a great shot. possibly a ribbon contender.', '2004-10-21 14:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(968500, 114172, 24925, '<td valign="top">Cute, but not something that captures my attention for more than a few seconds...I think zooming in and eliminating a lot of the peripheral elements of this photo would have helped the cause...</td>', 'Cute, but not something that captures my attention for more than a few seconds...I think zooming in and eliminating a lot of the peripheral elements of this photo would have helped the cause...', '2004-10-21 14:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(968502, 113200, 24925, '<td valign="top">To me, this isn''t very interesting to look at...what is this photo saying?  What was the reason for taking it? What''s with that background?  These are all things that need to be addressed.</td>', 'To me, this isn''t very interesting to look at...what is this photo saying?  What was the reason for taking it? What''s with that background?  These are all things that need to be addressed.', '2004-10-21 14:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(968503, 114241, 19010, '<td valign="top">seems a little boring. Perhaps with kids getting on and off the bus it might have livened it up some more. Nice focus and DOF however.</td>', 'seems a little boring. Perhaps with kids getting on and off the bus it might have livened it up some more. Nice focus and DOF however.', '2004-10-21 14:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(968504, 113542, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not sure quite how this relates to school... unless you''re visiting a school of fish...?</td>', 'Not sure quite how this relates to school... unless you''re visiting a school of fish...?', '2004-10-21 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(968505, 113601, 19010, '<td valign="top">it looks like the hand is holding the books up. perhaps a bit more of an explosion might have caught my attention.</td>', 'it looks like the hand is holding the books up. perhaps a bit more of an explosion might have caught my attention.', '2004-10-21 14:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(968506, 113592, 24925, '<td valign="top">The photo on it''s own is not too bad (though not great), but it doesn''t make me think of school...<br/> <br/>I think the photo itself could have been improved with a nicer sky (waiting for better light), offsetting the path and getting closer to the ground to take the photo...</td>', 'The photo on it''s own is not too bad (though not great), but it doesn''t make me think of school... I think the photo itself could have been improved with a nicer sky (waiting for better light), offsetting the path and getting closer to the ground to take the photo...', '2004-10-21 14:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(968509, 114243, 27524, '<td valign="top">Orginal way of capture. Like bright color of bus and leaves.</td>', 'Orginal way of capture. Like bright color of bus and leaves.', '2004-10-21 14:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(968510, 114144, 24925, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t appeal to me a whole lot and doesn''t really set any sort of a mood for me, which I think could be accomplished with better lighting and angle perhaps...</td>', 'This photo doesn''t appeal to me a whole lot and doesn''t really set any sort of a mood for me, which I think could be accomplished with better lighting and angle perhaps...', '2004-10-21 14:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(968511, 112829, 19010, '<td valign="top">nice shot, good focus. just feels cold. but hey that may just be the subject matter.</td>', 'nice shot, good focus. just feels cold. but hey that may just be the subject matter.', '2004-10-21 14:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(968512, 113464, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry... I just don''t get it...?</td>', 'I''m sorry... I just don''t get it...?', '2004-10-21 14:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(968513, 113006, 24925, '<td valign="top">This photo just looks cluttered and it looks more documentary than anything else. Yes, those are passports and money...but why am I looking at this photograph?</td>', 'This photo just looks cluttered and it looks more documentary than anything else. Yes, those are passports and money...but why am I looking at this photograph?', '2004-10-21 14:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(968514, 113985, 19010, '<td valign="top">good shot. I just don''t feel it fit into school day very well.</td>', 'good shot. I just don''t feel it fit into school day very well.', '2004-10-21 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(968515, 114024, 7322, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge but, sadly, it has a very amateurish, snapshot quality to it. A kindergarten coat room has a lot of potential for evoking nostalgia in the viewer but this just hasn''t captured that. It looks like the photographer just stuck his/her head into a closet and snapped the shot. The flash hurts the mood quite a bit (flash frequently does). For an interior shot a tripod is usually necessary to take advantage of natural light. A suggestion for how a shot of a coat room  could evoke an emotional response from the viewer is to create a set-up using just a few familar items you would find in the setting being sure to choose timeless, non-branded (no cartoons, sports teams, etc) items. Example---a brown paper lunch bag or plain colored lunch pail. galoshes (rain/winter boots), a simple nylon windbreaker or rain coat, Chuck Taylors'' or Keds'' sneakers (they''ve been around for several decades in pretty much the same form).</td>', 'This meets the challenge but, sadly, it has a very amateurish, snapshot quality to it. A kindergarten coat room has a lot of potential for evoking nostalgia in the viewer but this just hasn''t captured that. It looks like the photographer just stuck his/her head into a closet and snapped the shot. The flash hurts the mood quite a bit (flash frequently does). For an interior shot a tripod is usually necessary to take advantage of natural light. A suggestion for how a shot of a coat room  could evoke an emotional response from the viewer is to create a set-up using just a few familar items you would find in the setting being sure to choose timeless, non-branded (no cartoons, sports teams, etc) items. Example---a brown paper lunch bag or plain colored lunch pail. galoshes (rain/winter boots), a simple nylon windbreaker or rain coat, Chuck Taylors'' or Keds'' sneakers (they''ve been around for several decades in pretty much the same form).', '2004-10-21 14:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(968516, 112910, 24925, '<td valign="top">What was the purpose behind the choice of depth of field here?  I think a greater depth would have been nicer...or the same depth but have the focus on "The Twenty Maxims" instead.  A better choice in this area would have resulted in a 6...as is, I''ll have to give it a 4...</td>', 'What was the purpose behind the choice of depth of field here?  I think a greater depth would have been nicer...or the same depth but have the focus on "The Twenty Maxims" instead.  A better choice in this area would have resulted in a 6...as is, I''ll have to give it a 4...', '2004-10-21 14:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(968517, 113860, 19010, '<td valign="top">funny yet true. good subject matter.</td>', 'funny yet true. good subject matter.', '2004-10-21 14:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(968518, 113860, 24925, '<td valign="top">The background is very distracting here (is that a garbage can?)...</td>', 'The background is very distracting here (is that a garbage can?)...', '2004-10-21 14:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(968519, 114096, 19010, '<td valign="top">the photo is to crowded. and takes away from the center of intrest</td>', 'the photo is to crowded. and takes away from the center of intrest', '2004-10-21 14:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(968521, 113126, 19010, '<td valign="top">i dont know for sure but i think I would have liked the face to be a little more in focus. But otherwise i liked it.</td>', 'i dont know for sure but i think I would have liked the face to be a little more in focus. But otherwise i liked it.', '2004-10-21 14:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(968523, 114198, 19010, '<td valign="top">color i realy think this would have looked better in color. dark red apple smooth background. I think i could realy like this shot.</td>', 'color i realy think this would have looked better in color. dark red apple smooth background. I think i could realy like this shot.', '2004-10-21 14:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(968524, 113481, 19010, '<td valign="top">i feel you left the topic just a little otherwise good shot and idea</td>', 'i feel you left the topic just a little otherwise good shot and idea', '2004-10-21 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(968525, 113861, 19010, '<td valign="top">A little sharper and this would have been one of my favorites.</td>', 'A little sharper and this would have been one of my favorites.', '2004-10-21 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(968528, 113592, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but not particularly strong on the "school" theme...</td>', 'A nice shot, but not particularly strong on the "school" theme...', '2004-10-21 14:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(968530, 114211, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very odd looking backround.  My guess is you got a white sheet and used that and I don´t think it´s working very well.  Either it should be moved further back to make it more blurry or just skip it alltogher and try to set this in an actual classroom.  Anyway, good shot nonetheless, I like it.</td>', 'Very odd looking backround.  My guess is you got a white sheet and used that and I don´t think it´s working very well.  Either it should be moved further back to make it more blurry or just skip it alltogher and try to set this in an actual classroom.  Anyway, good shot nonetheless, I like it.', '2004-10-21 14:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(968531, 113978, 19010, '<td valign="top">as an enginner myself i want to know when she graguates :) I like the shot and the concept. But just can''t brink myself to want to hang it on my wall.</td>', 'as an enginner myself i want to know when she graguates :) I like the shot and the concept. But just can''t brink myself to want to hang it on my wall.', '2004-10-21 14:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(968533, 114192, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks very snapshot-y to me. There is potential for an interesting photo (mostly because of the colorful apples) but this really hasn''t captured that potential. It looks rather random to me. Also, please take advantage of the 640 pixel maximum you are allowed. It is hard to evaluate smaller photos for detail in the shadows and highlights.</td>', 'This looks very snapshot-y to me. There is potential for an interesting photo (mostly because of the colorful apples) but this really hasn''t captured that potential. It looks rather random to me. Also, please take advantage of the 640 pixel maximum you are allowed. It is hard to evaluate smaller photos for detail in the shadows and highlights.', '2004-10-21 14:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(968535, 114138, 18403, '<td valign="top">This is nostalgic!  In the ''good ol'' days'' we rarely had less than 35 kids in a classroom, but the quiet, respectful demeanor of the kids was more conducive to learning than the chaotic classrooms of 15 kids today.  BTW, great shot!</td>', 'This is nostalgic!  In the ''good ol'' days'' we rarely had less than 35 kids in a classroom, but the quiet, respectful demeanor of the kids was more conducive to learning than the chaotic classrooms of 15 kids today.  BTW, great shot!', '2004-10-21 14:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(968536, 114028, 19010, '<td valign="top">good shot good concept. nice color. hate the angle its just to much for me</td>', 'good shot good concept. nice color. hate the angle its just to much for me', '2004-10-21 14:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(968537, 113227, 3102, '<td valign="top">I assume you''re able to make this judgement because you are personally the epitome of fine human form.</td>', 'I assume you''re able to make this judgement because you are personally the epitome of fine human form.', '2004-10-21 14:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(968538, 114072, 19010, '<td valign="top">if it was a complety new idea i would have fallen in love. But i hsve already seen the heart trick on DPC. otherwise nice shot good definition.</td>', 'if it was a complety new idea i would have fallen in love. But i hsve already seen the heart trick on DPC. otherwise nice shot good definition.', '2004-10-21 14:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(968539, 113895, 19010, '<td valign="top">mr elliott is a little out of focus.</td>', 'mr elliott is a little out of focus.', '2004-10-21 14:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(968540, 114048, 19010, '<td valign="top">cute photo but a little blurry</td>', 'cute photo but a little blurry', '2004-10-21 14:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(968541, 113852, 7322, '<td valign="top">A really good effort but I find the motion blur is just too much of a good thing. Don''t get me wrong---I like some motion blur. I just feel that a greater area of sharp focus on the boy holding the football would have created a bit more visual impact, IMO. As it is, the onlyl sharp area of focus is on his wrist andpart of his sleeve. Even the ball and most of his hand suffer from some motion blur. As it is, a quick viewing leaves the impression that the blur is created by camera shake.</td>', 'A really good effort but I find the motion blur is just too much of a good thing. Don''t get me wrong---I like some motion blur. I just feel that a greater area of sharp focus on the boy holding the football would have created a bit more visual impact, IMO. As it is, the onlyl sharp area of focus is on his wrist andpart of his sleeve. Even the ball and most of his hand suffer from some motion blur. As it is, a quick viewing leaves the impression that the blur is created by camera shake.', '2004-10-21 14:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(968542, 114237, 19010, '<td valign="top">i like it action, fun, laughter, maybe a little more color on the characters, and a less distracting background would have helped.</td>', 'i like it action, fun, laughter, maybe a little more color on the characters, and a less distracting background would have helped.', '2004-10-21 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(968544, 113877, 19010, '<td valign="top">just not very Exciting .</td>', 'just not very Exciting .', '2004-10-21 14:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(968545, 113502, 18971, '<td valign="top">n</td>', 'n', '2004-10-21 14:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(968546, 112845, 18403, '<td valign="top">Potential for a good image but needs better contrast, level camera, and a more appealing angle. perhaps move the camera left and shoot more toward the right.</td>', 'Potential for a good image but needs better contrast, level camera, and a more appealing angle. perhaps move the camera left and shoot more toward the right.', '2004-10-21 14:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(968548, 114123, 19010, '<td valign="top">ok now im forced to ask how do you do double exposures on a digital. I''m Jealous only scorring low because I fail to see the relationship between the bible and school.</td>', 'ok now im forced to ask how do you do double exposures on a digital. I''m Jealous only scorring low because I fail to see the relationship between the bible and school.', '2004-10-21 14:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(968549, 113840, 19010, '<td valign="top">nice concept but the background peices are a bit out of focus.</td>', 'nice concept but the background peices are a bit out of focus.', '2004-10-21 14:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(968551, 114050, 18403, '<td valign="top">A greater DOF would improve this image, particularly if the subject person was in better focus.  Nice angle and composition.</td>', 'A greater DOF would improve this image, particularly if the subject person was in better focus.  Nice angle and composition.', '2004-10-21 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(968552, 113095, 19010, '<td valign="top">a wider shot with one or two more people and you might have had me feeling sorry for the girls. but as is it lacked interest to me.</td>', 'a wider shot with one or two more people and you might have had me feeling sorry for the girls. but as is it lacked interest to me.', '2004-10-21 14:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(968554, 114212, 19010, '<td valign="top">I remeber those days.. Its a little out of focus. But thats how i remeber them a little fuzzy.</td>', 'I remeber those days.. Its a little out of focus. But thats how i remeber them a little fuzzy.', '2004-10-21 14:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(968556, 114211, 18403, '<td valign="top">Good except for the backdrop cloth on the right side.  Maybe a strong backlight on that side would obscure the cloth and highlight the subject. 6</td>', 'Good except for the backdrop cloth on the right side.  Maybe a strong backlight on that side would obscure the cloth and highlight the subject. 6', '2004-10-21 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(968557, 113528, 19010, '<td valign="top">is this a negative? oww my brain hurts. to much math...education.  I like the concept and the POV.</td>', 'is this a negative? oww my brain hurts. to much math...education.  I like the concept and the POV.', '2004-10-21 14:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(968558, 113653, 19010, '<td valign="top">I like the photo. I think I would have enjoyed some richer colors.</td>', 'I like the photo. I think I would have enjoyed some richer colors.', '2004-10-21 14:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(968559, 113919, 12311, '<td valign="top">...but what do you want to be when you grow up?  ;-)  I''m only a dozen years away from that age.  When we stop learning, we stop living.  Nice detail here, a little humor, ...and I''m wondering about the significance of the only readable title on the shelf: "Wine"??  Good job</td>', '...but what do you want to be when you grow up?  ;-)  I''m only a dozen years away from that age.  When we stop learning, we stop living.  Nice detail here, a little humor, ...and I''m wondering about the significance of the only readable title on the shelf: "Wine"??  Good job', '2004-10-21 14:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(968560, 114080, 19010, '<td valign="top">its a sighn above a door or window. I would like to have seen more of the school house.</td>', 'its a sighn above a door or window. I would like to have seen more of the school house.', '2004-10-21 14:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(968561, 114241, 7322, '<td valign="top">School buses have potential to be great photographic subjects but it takes a careful approach in order for the subject to rise above the mundane and become unique. This is a very literal approach--appropriate if you want to show someone who has never seen a school bus what they look like but not very stimulating in terms of visual interest to the rest of us who see school buses on a daily basis. Photography (and all art, really) is about ''seeing'' the world in a personal way and then communicating your unique vision to your audience in such  a way as to provoke an emotional response.</td>', 'School buses have potential to be great photographic subjects but it takes a careful approach in order for the subject to rise above the mundane and become unique. This is a very literal approach--appropriate if you want to show someone who has never seen a school bus what they look like but not very stimulating in terms of visual interest to the rest of us who see school buses on a daily basis. Photography (and all art, really) is about ''seeing'' the world in a personal way and then communicating your unique vision to your audience in such  a way as to provoke an emotional response.', '2004-10-21 14:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
