(968750, 114243, 25921, '<td valign="top">There is great potential in this photo, but the mirror just seems to be too far to the edge of the photo.</td>', 'There is great potential in this photo, but the mirror just seems to be too far to the edge of the photo.', '2004-10-21 17:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
