(968760, 113227, 25921, '<td valign="top">Man she would be mortified to know her  picture showed up here under this title.  Unfortunately, I have to admit to a small involuntary chuckle at this photo though.</td>', 'Man she would be mortified to know her  picture showed up here under this title.  Unfortunately, I have to admit to a small involuntary chuckle at this photo though.', '2004-10-21 17:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
