(968763, 114050, 25921, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen a greater DOF to see the student better.  But even so, this is an excellent perspective shot.</td>', 'I would like to have seen a greater DOF to see the student better.  But even so, this is an excellent perspective shot.', '2004-10-21 17:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(968771, 114144, 16488, '<td valign="top">Ahh...learning by osmosis!<br/> <br/>The lighting is very pretty, it isolates your subject well.  Love the colors and the softeness in this.  Of its type in this challenge, yours is one of the few where the subject really appears to be asleep.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Ahh...learning by osmosis! The lighting is very pretty, it isolates your subject well.  Love the colors and the softeness in this.  Of its type in this challenge, yours is one of the few where the subject really appears to be asleep.  Nicely done.', '2004-10-21 17:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(968775, 114096, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the setting, the framing, and the studious attitude of the subject.  However, it shows up very dark, even on my "other" well-calibrated monitor.  I think this could be fixed in processing as it seems that the tonal range is all there.</td>', 'I like the setting, the framing, and the studious attitude of the subject.  However, it shows up very dark, even on my "other" well-calibrated monitor.  I think this could be fixed in processing as it seems that the tonal range is all there.', '2004-10-21 17:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
