(968791, 114067, 1827, '<td valign="top">I can see that thought was given to the arrangement, but to me there is more interest in the yearbook than the pens, so I''d like less of the frame on the pens. 5, just-married</td>', 'I can see that thought was given to the arrangement, but to me there is more interest in the yearbook than the pens, so I''d like less of the frame on the pens. 5, just-married', '2004-10-21 17:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(968794, 114140, 1827, '<td valign="top">Nothing here really captures my interest.  Without the title, this photo doesn''t stand on it''s own IMO. 4, just-married</td>', 'Nothing here really captures my interest.  Without the title, this photo doesn''t stand on it''s own IMO. 4, just-married', '2004-10-21 17:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(968798, 114048, 1827, '<td valign="top">An apple with a bite missing and a dinosaur poking out?  On top of a lesson plan for a digital photo?  I missed the joke.  DOF is good. 3, just-married</td>', 'An apple with a bite missing and a dinosaur poking out?  On top of a lesson plan for a digital photo?  I missed the joke.  DOF is good. 3, just-married', '2004-10-21 17:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
