(968834, 114043, 1827, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to say there was camera shake; lighting is creating harsh shadows.  More to the point for me is that it just feels like a photo of a coin.  Perhaps a macro shot that got in close enough to disguise the fact that we''re even looking at a coin could have captured my interest better. 3, just-married</td>', 'Focus seems to say there was camera shake; lighting is creating harsh shadows.  More to the point for me is that it just feels like a photo of a coin.  Perhaps a macro shot that got in close enough to disguise the fact that we''re even looking at a coin could have captured my interest better. 3, just-married', '2004-10-21 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(968840, 113137, 27244, '<td valign="top">Im not getting the vibe from this image... based on the title perhaps more than one teen dressed up could be better?  To show that it''s the high school costume night.</td>', 'Im not getting the vibe from this image... based on the title perhaps more than one teen dressed up could be better?  To show that it''s the high school costume night.', '2004-10-21 18:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
