(969917, 112899, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great portrait</td>', 'Great portrait', '2004-10-22 15:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(969918, 113364, 13759, '<td valign="top">This fit very well to the challenge. But it may be taken in a very complex situation. The light was not right, the scene was too dynamic and seems that you are not so close as you need to catch it up perfectly. The use of an speedlight can help you to get the velocity, compensating for the distance and focal lenght. Good luck.</td>', 'This fit very well to the challenge. But it may be taken in a very complex situation. The light was not right, the scene was too dynamic and seems that you are not so close as you need to catch it up perfectly. The use of an speedlight can help you to get the velocity, compensating for the distance and focal lenght. Good luck.', '2004-10-22 15:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(969921, 114250, 10988, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2004-10-22 15:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(969923, 114244, 3569, '<td valign="top">the light shade? on right somewhat distracting, but everything else is nice</td>', 'the light shade? on right somewhat distracting, but everything else is nice', '2004-10-22 15:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(969927, 114123, 3569, '<td valign="top">My childrens school has guns and the bible!  We home school!</td>', 'My childrens school has guns and the bible!  We home school!', '2004-10-22 15:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(969931, 114251, 13759, '<td valign="top">Lateral light is very useful to landscape photography. On this case you loose a bit of bright in the building cause that light. This make me whatch to the sky, not to the building, your primary subject.</td>', 'Lateral light is very useful to landscape photography. On this case you loose a bit of bright in the building cause that light. This make me whatch to the sky, not to the building, your primary subject.', '2004-10-22 15:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(969937, 113996, 13759, '<td valign="top">Nice use of movement. This motion blur adds a lot to the picture. It´s a nice picture, but say´s nothing to me about school. Ok, I´m from latin america! May be you only can try to explain it to me. I´m very curious. Thank´s.</td>', 'Nice use of movement. This motion blur adds a lot to the picture. It´s a nice picture, but say´s nothing to me about school. Ok, I´m from latin america! May be you only can try to explain it to me. I´m very curious. Thank´s.', '2004-10-22 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
