(969941, 114250, 13759, '<td valign="top">It talks hard to me about school days. In my school days we study music too. Nice picture, very well done. Composition and exposure is in perfect harmony! Good luck.</td>', 'It talks hard to me about school days. In my school days we study music too. Nice picture, very well done. Composition and exposure is in perfect harmony! Good luck.', '2004-10-22 15:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
