(969971, 114140, 16488, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here!  Well-chosen items to represent the many facets of a shoolchild''s life... I have to admit I haven''t made up my mind about the choice of lighting.  On the one hand it helps some of the items stand out, such as the pencil, coins and rubberband chain.  On the other hand it complicates the shoelace...o.k. 1 negative vs 3 positives, you win.</td>', 'I love the idea here!  Well-chosen items to represent the many facets of a shoolchild''s life... I have to admit I haven''t made up my mind about the choice of lighting.  On the one hand it helps some of the items stand out, such as the pencil, coins and rubberband chain.  On the other hand it complicates the shoelace...o.k. 1 negative vs 3 positives, you win.', '2004-10-22 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(969972, 113128, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I like the way the larger structure is implied by the geometric shadow.  Lovely texture and colors.  I''ll believe its a schoolhouse because you say so.  Might have cropped a little off the left, but that''s just a minor quibble.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I like the way the larger structure is implied by the geometric shadow.  Lovely texture and colors.  I''ll believe its a schoolhouse because you say so.  Might have cropped a little off the left, but that''s just a minor quibble.', '2004-10-22 16:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(970035, 113498, 26878, '<td valign="top">This is what im doing in school now and I so very much hate it. lol   other then that the paper looks white like it should, um maybe could have threw a TI - 83 in there or similiar calculator, but other then that it looks great. 8</td>', 'This is what im doing in school now and I so very much hate it. lol   other then that the paper looks white like it should, um maybe could have threw a TI - 83 in there or similiar calculator, but other then that it looks great. 8', '2004-10-22 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
