(970232, 114162, 22970, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite photographs. The subject caught my attention and was sharp as needed in this photo. The exposure imo was good along with the contrast and I love the colors. A well-balanced photograph taken from a good perspective. Great photo!</td>', 'This is one of my favorite photographs. The subject caught my attention and was sharp as needed in this photo. The exposure imo was good along with the contrast and I love the colors. A well-balanced photograph taken from a good perspective. Great photo!', '2004-10-22 23:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(970237, 113126, 22970, '<td valign="top">A great low key photograph that fits the challenge imo. I think the subject being out of focus and her reaction in focus was a plus to this photo. Well balanced and a good perspective. Great job! An additional note I was just reading on low key photography a night or two a go and the definition of low key photography fits your photograph well.<br/>[Low key pictures concentrate on the darker tones, often conveying an atmosphere of tension or a powerful deep strength.] And IMO I believe thats what you were trying to covey with your photograph. Just my 2 Cents!</td>', 'A great low key photograph that fits the challenge imo. I think the subject being out of focus and her reaction in focus was a plus to this photo. Well balanced and a good perspective. Great job! An additional note I was just reading on low key photography a night or two a go and the definition of low key photography fits your photograph well.[Low key pictures concentrate on the darker tones, often conveying an atmosphere of tension or a powerful deep strength.] And IMO I believe thats what you were trying to covey with your photograph. Just my 2 Cents!', '2004-10-22 23:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(970239, 113542, 28045, '<td valign="top">Nice Pic but what does it have to do with School?</td>', 'Nice Pic but what does it have to do with School?', '2004-10-22 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(970242, 114032, 22970, '<td valign="top">I liked this photo when I saw the thumbnail edition. When I opened it up to see the large picture so I could get a good view the subject still trapped my attention. But it does seem to be to some extent out of focus witch was disappointing. But a good photograph.</td>', 'I liked this photo when I saw the thumbnail edition. When I opened it up to see the large picture so I could get a good view the subject still trapped my attention. But it does seem to be to some extent out of focus witch was disappointing. But a good photograph.', '2004-10-22 23:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(970246, 113227, 22970, '<td valign="top">Dont you think the title was tactless when the subject is identifiable?</td>', 'Dont you think the title was tactless when the subject is identifiable?', '2004-10-22 23:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(970251, 113212, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo but slightly over exposed.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo but slightly over exposed.', '2004-10-22 23:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(970291, 114242, 11895, '<td valign="top">the lights at the top of the bookcases are pretty harsh, maybe you could have shot from a higher point of view so they were not shining so directly into your camera; the woodwork in the background is an attractive part of the image</td>', 'the lights at the top of the bookcases are pretty harsh, maybe you could have shot from a higher point of view so they were not shining so directly into your camera; the woodwork in the background is an attractive part of the image', '2004-10-23 00:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(970296, 113795, 11895, '<td valign="top">very bright with not enough contrast, approaches over exposure IMO</td>', 'very bright with not enough contrast, approaches over exposure IMO', '2004-10-23 00:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(970301, 114254, 24511, '<td valign="top">Walk towards the light theme enjoyable.  I loved this being my first photo and venture a high score of 8.  The sun shape rises and sets on education with every day an opportunity to learn.  The moon shape reminds me of late night study sessions.  Few colors but loved the beautiful lines enhances by the vertical sizing of image.  The book spine''s curves give depth.  Thanks.</td>', 'Walk towards the light theme enjoyable.  I loved this being my first photo and venture a high score of 8.  The sun shape rises and sets on education with every day an opportunity to learn.  The moon shape reminds me of late night study sessions.  Few colors but loved the beautiful lines enhances by the vertical sizing of image.  The book spine''s curves give depth.  Thanks.', '2004-10-23 00:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(970303, 112872, 28005, '<td valign="top">Love the idea!  It''s exactly the sort of thing that reminds me of school without being overdone.  The photograph looks a little too posed though...I''d like to see an alternate version taken from over the reader''s shoulder (right where a teacher would sneak up and catch him/her in the act).  Instead of using the book cover to indicate what the book is, you could have the comics only cover part of the page, leaving some sort of recognizable chart or illustration exposed.</td>', 'Love the idea!  It''s exactly the sort of thing that reminds me of school without being overdone.  The photograph looks a little too posed though...I''d like to see an alternate version taken from over the reader''s shoulder (right where a teacher would sneak up and catch him/her in the act).  Instead of using the book cover to indicate what the book is, you could have the comics only cover part of the page, leaving some sort of recognizable chart or illustration exposed.', '2004-10-23 00:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(970305, 113999, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very busy.  Very serious classroom.  Very realistic.  I hope education becomes much more challenging and creative looking in the future.  Come to think of it, my submission feels much less interesting than yours.  I love the reflection of the students on the television screen and the red heart on the wall next to the teacher.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Very busy.  Very serious classroom.  Very realistic.  I hope education becomes much more challenging and creative looking in the future.  Come to think of it, my submission feels much less interesting than yours.  I love the reflection of the students on the television screen and the red heart on the wall next to the teacher.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-10-23 00:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(970307, 114050, 11895, '<td valign="top">more depth of field would have put the face to be in focus, the books are taking too much attention away from it</td>', 'more depth of field would have put the face to be in focus, the books are taking too much attention away from it', '2004-10-23 00:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(970310, 113891, 24511, '<td valign="top">When I see this bell I think church bell mainly because the architecture seem so modern like many religious buildings raised near my home.  I would have scored higher if there was a student, teacher or school visual to support the main theme.  Thanks for the photo.  Bells shadow was my favorite point of interest.</td>', 'When I see this bell I think church bell mainly because the architecture seem so modern like many religious buildings raised near my home.  I would have scored higher if there was a student, teacher or school visual to support the main theme.  Thanks for the photo.  Bells shadow was my favorite point of interest.', '2004-10-23 00:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(970315, 113056, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great focus, terribly awful good use of dark shadow, pallette of two blue lines traced by lower book splendid balance. Choice of books magic with composition triangle exquisite both visually and tripple R''ally.  First 10 this challenge for me.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Great focus, terribly awful good use of dark shadow, pallette of two blue lines traced by lower book splendid balance. Choice of books magic with composition triangle exquisite both visually and tripple R''ally.  First 10 this challenge for me.  Congratulations.', '2004-10-23 01:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(970320, 113542, 24511, '<td valign="top">Loved the photo but reminds me of what my dreams are like when my teacher is boring.  Maybe this photographer did a lot of daydreaming in school to become an inventor or a great artist.  School''s out for summer points for changing my focus away from all these classroom photos.</td>', 'Loved the photo but reminds me of what my dreams are like when my teacher is boring.  Maybe this photographer did a lot of daydreaming in school to become an inventor or a great artist.  School''s out for summer points for changing my focus away from all these classroom photos.', '2004-10-23 01:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
