(970340, 114255, 24511, '<td valign="top">Architecture, museum, window frame, lighting, high class education perhaps...I loved the lines and architecture but I had to rub my eyes before education became the focal point.  I enjoyed the dim visual shapes seen in the middle and upper right corner shadows away from the window.  Thanks for the photo.</td>', 'Architecture, museum, window frame, lighting, high class education perhaps...I loved the lines and architecture but I had to rub my eyes before education became the focal point.  I enjoyed the dim visual shapes seen in the middle and upper right corner shadows away from the window.  Thanks for the photo.', '2004-10-23 01:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(970343, 114206, 22970, '<td valign="top">We don''t need no education <br/>We don''t need no thought control <br/>No dark sarcasm in the classroom <br/>Teachers leave the kids alone.....<br/>Great Photograph, I knew where you were going with it when I saw the picture, I didnt even have to read the title. The only thing distracting to me is the solid black and very thick border, but thats an personal opinion. Great job!<br/></td>', 'We don''t need no education We don''t need no thought control No dark sarcasm in the classroom Teachers leave the kids alone.....Great Photograph, I knew where you were going with it when I saw the picture, I didnt even have to read the title. The only thing distracting to me is the solid black and very thick border, but thats an personal opinion. Great job!', '2004-10-23 01:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(970350, 113592, 22970, '<td valign="top">I dont see how the photograph meets the challenge of education. But thats just my opinion. However you have taken a good and interesting photograph. I will be coming backing to this photograph over and over until the challenge ends to see if I can find a link between the photo, title, and challenge.</td>', 'I dont see how the photograph meets the challenge of education. But thats just my opinion. However you have taken a good and interesting photograph. I will be coming backing to this photograph over and over until the challenge ends to see if I can find a link between the photo, title, and challenge.', '2004-10-23 01:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
