(970361, 114162, 18450, '<td valign="top">Really like this image! Great colours, focus and dof......and the leg coming out from the side is perfect!</td>', 'Really like this image! Great colours, focus and dof......and the leg coming out from the side is perfect!', '2004-10-23 01:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(970366, 113418, 24511, '<td valign="top">This is the world of learning all right but education unfortunately is never on our minds in everyday life.  We are often learning much more here than in stereotypical settings that will probably score higher in this challenge.  How can someone so alert and bright eyes not be in learning mode.  6 for great photo and learning that comes natural.</td>', 'This is the world of learning all right but education unfortunately is never on our minds in everyday life.  We are often learning much more here than in stereotypical settings that will probably score higher in this challenge.  How can someone so alert and bright eyes not be in learning mode.  6 for great photo and learning that comes natural.', '2004-10-23 01:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(970369, 114047, 24511, '<td valign="top">This is my second bell this challenge and I can''t get around my myth of seing the ocean ship, a church or wondering what pitch the bell tolls.  I like the red brick that reminds me of the three pigs and lego blocks and yes I admit it an old school..Ok, Ok you get points for clarity and theme.  I would have scored higher for a less face to face shot with a bit more shadow for variety and movement.  Thanks.</td>', 'This is my second bell this challenge and I can''t get around my myth of seing the ocean ship, a church or wondering what pitch the bell tolls.  I like the red brick that reminds me of the three pigs and lego blocks and yes I admit it an old school..Ok, Ok you get points for clarity and theme.  I would have scored higher for a less face to face shot with a bit more shadow for variety and movement.  Thanks.', '2004-10-23 02:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(970374, 113860, 24511, '<td valign="top">I''m begining to think that education is an exercise in relaxation or a brain draining event.  I guess there is no replacing early to bed and rise, good food and exercise.  I love the combination of whites and darks between papers, sweater and sunlight vs vest hair + shadow and background furniture.  Good 8 mate.</td>', 'I''m begining to think that education is an exercise in relaxation or a brain draining event.  I guess there is no replacing early to bed and rise, good food and exercise.  I love the combination of whites and darks between papers, sweater and sunlight vs vest hair + shadow and background furniture.  Good 8 mate.', '2004-10-23 02:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(970380, 114123, 17103, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I really don''t understand this one....</td>', 'Hmmm... I really don''t understand this one....', '2004-10-23 02:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(970381, 113055, 24511, '<td valign="top">My previous vote was also a sleeper but yours got an extra point for angle choice, better use of light and shadow, the out of place plate with mysterious items and of course the earing.  I believe the choice of black and white helps keep the photo from being too busy.  Niner fine by me.</td>', 'My previous vote was also a sleeper but yours got an extra point for angle choice, better use of light and shadow, the out of place plate with mysterious items and of course the earing.  I believe the choice of black and white helps keep the photo from being too busy.  Niner fine by me.', '2004-10-23 02:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(970385, 114162, 17103, '<td valign="top">Nice place!  I wish my walk to class had been this pretty.  Is it me or is this photo a bit tilted??</td>', 'Nice place!  I wish my walk to class had been this pretty.  Is it me or is this photo a bit tilted??', '2004-10-23 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(970389, 113919, 24511, '<td valign="top">It is never too late to learn.  You can teach an old dog new tricks.  Subject seems very relaxed.  Are you sure he hasn''t been reading too much of the wine book in the upper right shelve?  Very busy but nice photo for family type album.  Thanks.</td>', 'It is never too late to learn.  You can teach an old dog new tricks.  Subject seems very relaxed.  Are you sure he hasn''t been reading too much of the wine book in the upper right shelve?  Very busy but nice photo for family type album.  Thanks.', '2004-10-23 02:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(970399, 113960, 24511, '<td valign="top">Love the crisp stillness of the main subject with the swirling bystanders movements.  Nice primairy colors brighten otherwise dull beige background.  Did not like brightness of upper right but enjoyed the contrast, the shadow play and the very bright blue teapot-yo-yo shape on the back pack.  Thanks for your 10</td>', 'Love the crisp stillness of the main subject with the swirling bystanders movements.  Nice primairy colors brighten otherwise dull beige background.  Did not like brightness of upper right but enjoyed the contrast, the shadow play and the very bright blue teapot-yo-yo shape on the back pack.  Thanks for your 10', '2004-10-23 02:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(970404, 112899, 24511, '<td valign="top">Forget the falling asleep shots.  Here is where the imagination collides with the three R''s.  This is where schooling ends and thinking independently begins.  Is this visual boredom or vigourous math calculations or even the creative genius about to invent atomic hydrogen fuel?  I just love everything about this shot.  No contest 10 times thanks.</td>', 'Forget the falling asleep shots.  Here is where the imagination collides with the three R''s.  This is where schooling ends and thinking independently begins.  Is this visual boredom or vigourous math calculations or even the creative genius about to invent atomic hydrogen fuel?  I just love everything about this shot.  No contest 10 times thanks.', '2004-10-23 02:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
