(970424, 114170, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well at least this isnt a close up of the school bus :). Though by the amount of school bus entries one would think that American education subsists enitrely in the trip to and from school. Anyway Ill give you a six for making the effort to crouch down low and liven up the composition...Shame its such a dark day - a bit more sunishine and you''d get an extra point.</td>', 'Well at least this isnt a close up of the school bus :). Though by the amount of school bus entries one would think that American education subsists enitrely in the trip to and from school. Anyway Ill give you a six for making the effort to crouch down low and liven up the composition...Shame its such a dark day - a bit more sunishine and you''d get an extra point.', '2004-10-23 02:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
