(970453, 113832, 27359, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2004-10-23 03:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(970462, 113464, 26679, '<td valign="top">More light on Santa would lift this photo.</td>', 'More light on Santa would lift this photo.', '2004-10-23 05:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(970464, 113048, 26679, '<td valign="top">I remember these days. There would be more impact if the bear was facing the camera.</td>', 'I remember these days. There would be more impact if the bear was facing the camera.', '2004-10-23 05:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(970467, 113351, 26679, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this was predictable stereotype. But looking at the photo a little longer reveals a very good photograph with a strong composition.</td>', 'My first reaction to this was predictable stereotype. But looking at the photo a little longer reveals a very good photograph with a strong composition.', '2004-10-23 05:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(970469, 114144, 26679, '<td valign="top">This picture has good composition. However for me the lighting does not quite work. A second source is needed from the right to reduce the strength of the shadows</td>', 'This picture has good composition. However for me the lighting does not quite work. A second source is needed from the right to reduce the strength of the shadows', '2004-10-23 05:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(970472, 114210, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and colour of this image. And this is one of my favourites from the challenge. My only concern is that the image does not suggest school days as well as others. <br/> <br/>Catch 22 was not on the curriculum when I was at school, so I associate it more with late teens and early adult hood.<br/> <br/>Revisiting<br/><i>I thought this would have done better.</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-29 04:28:20.</i></td>', 'I love the composition and colour of this image. And this is one of my favourites from the challenge. My only concern is that the image does not suggest school days as well as others.  Catch 22 was not on the curriculum when I was at school, so I associate it more with late teens and early adult hood. RevisitingI thought this would have done better.', '2004-10-23 05:37:15.000000', '2004-10-29 05:28:20.000000', 1),
(970475, 113978, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is a well taken and composed photograph. I would have preferred not to have to have seen more of the colour on the right hand side, as I find the light in the bottom right hand corner distracting.<br/> <br/>When I was a school we were not allowed to use calculators, so for me it was log tables, and tedious re-iterations  <br/></td>', 'This is a well taken and composed photograph. I would have preferred not to have to have seen more of the colour on the right hand side, as I find the light in the bottom right hand corner distracting. When I was a school we were not allowed to use calculators, so for me it was log tables, and tedious re-iterations  ', '2004-10-23 05:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(970477, 114253, 26679, '<td valign="top">Good Balance and composition. The diagonal works well with this image. You have worked on the lighting to try and avoid glare on an individual key, which is not easy.<br/> <br/>One observation is that a typewriter does not say schooldays to me. For me it was pencils a rubber, with lots of rubbing out.  (I am a Brit in Britain, Rubber = Eraser, and not anything else)<br/></td>', 'Good Balance and composition. The diagonal works well with this image. You have worked on the lighting to try and avoid glare on an individual key, which is not easy. One observation is that a typewriter does not say schooldays to me. For me it was pencils a rubber, with lots of rubbing out.  (I am a Brit in Britain, Rubber = Eraser, and not anything else)', '2004-10-23 05:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(970478, 113465, 26679, '<td valign="top">Lovely image of tree in front of a building. The picture is well composed and balanced. However this is an international challange, and without the tittle I would not have known that this was a school.<br/> <br/>You have obviously kept exactly to the instruction and I recognise and reward this. My observation is to try and think of what other may see if they were raised and live in other countries.<br/></td>', 'Lovely image of tree in front of a building. The picture is well composed and balanced. However this is an international challange, and without the tittle I would not have known that this was a school. You have obviously kept exactly to the instruction and I recognise and reward this. My observation is to try and think of what other may see if they were raised and live in other countries.', '2004-10-23 05:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(970479, 114251, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I have observed on other pictures that without the title I would not have known their image was of a school building. This is not the case here.<br/> <br/>This is an iconic image of an American Educational Facility, and easily recognisable by a Brit like me.<br/> <br/>The chosen angle for the shot works well for me and the balance of the tree at top left with the bush  bottom right works very well.<br/> <br/>Revisiting<i> <br/>Still looks excellalent to me</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-27 03:13:01.</i></td>', 'This is a great shot, I have observed on other pictures that without the title I would not have known their image was of a school building. This is not the case here. This is an iconic image of an American Educational Facility, and easily recognisable by a Brit like me. The chosen angle for the shot works well for me and the balance of the tree at top left with the bush  bottom right works very well. Revisiting Still looks excellalent to me', '2004-10-23 06:00:19.000000', '2004-10-27 04:13:01.000000', 1),
(970483, 112629, 26679, '<td valign="top">One has to be very careful with photographs that are very specific of one country, as not everyone will understand what you are trying top convey.<br/> <br/>I feel that the light is a little strong on the pearls and desk top, and perhaps a secondary light would have helped to reduce some of the shadow.<br/></td>', 'One has to be very careful with photographs that are very specific of one country, as not everyone will understand what you are trying top convey. I feel that the light is a little strong on the pearls and desk top, and perhaps a secondary light would have helped to reduce some of the shadow.', '2004-10-23 06:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(970484, 114236, 26679, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail does not do this picture justice.  <br/> <br/>                           I like it. <br/> <br/>I suspect that you will have negative feedback from some.  <br/></td>', 'The thumbnail does not do this picture justice.                              I like it.  I suspect that you will have negative feedback from some.  ', '2004-10-23 06:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(970486, 114029, 26679, '<td valign="top">It is an interesting take, on a common image. And rotating the image in this way will probably get some interesting feedback.<br/> <br/>I feel that if you had placed the recorder across the picture you would have achieved a more dynamic impact.<br/></td>', 'It is an interesting take, on a common image. And rotating the image in this way will probably get some interesting feedback. I feel that if you had placed the recorder across the picture you would have achieved a more dynamic impact.', '2004-10-23 06:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(970488, 113200, 26679, '<td valign="top">I feel that this image could be improved with the use of a different background. The Tartan is rather distracting.</td>', 'I feel that this image could be improved with the use of a different background. The Tartan is rather distracting.', '2004-10-23 06:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(970489, 113476, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the image and compostion. The seat was a little less bright.</td>', 'I love the image and compostion. The seat was a little less bright.', '2004-10-23 06:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(970495, 114059, 24983, '<td valign="top">a really happy image these kids sure are enjoying themselves.</td>', 'a really happy image these kids sure are enjoying themselves.', '2004-10-23 06:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(970496, 114162, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this. A grand imposing picture- I like it.<br/> <br/>To be a little nit picking, the title is "The walk to class" yet the image shows push bikes and someone sitting down. This image would be better without these two and an image of someone walking through the arch/ across the arch<br/></td>', 'I like the composition of this. A grand imposing picture- I like it. To be a little nit picking, the title is "The walk to class" yet the image shows push bikes and someone sitting down. This image would be better without these two and an image of someone walking through the arch/ across the arch', '2004-10-23 06:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(970497, 113833, 24983, '<td valign="top">well handled ,nice conception and very well photographed</td>', 'well handled ,nice conception and very well photographed', '2004-10-23 06:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(970498, 113308, 26679, '<td valign="top">Good strong composition. Simplicity always works.</td>', 'Good strong composition. Simplicity always works.', '2004-10-23 06:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(970499, 112947, 24983, '<td valign="top">Great happy image I really like it. but it could have been photographed any where.<br/>however its a 6 with me.</td>', 'Great happy image I really like it. but it could have been photographed any where.however its a 6 with me.', '2004-10-23 06:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(970500, 114016, 24983, '<td valign="top">this is a supurb image as far as Iam concerned and it really suits the theme I love the light and the oof figure behind adds interest 10from me</td>', 'this is a supurb image as far as Iam concerned and it really suits the theme I love the light and the oof figure behind adds interest 10from me', '2004-10-23 06:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(970502, 114140, 26679, '<td valign="top">The only obviosly British Photo. (Its the conker that gives the game away) I feel that the light source is a little to bright casing glare on the coins and the writing on the pencil/ smartie cap.</td>', 'The only obviosly British Photo. (Its the conker that gives the game away) I feel that the light source is a little to bright casing glare on the coins and the writing on the pencil/ smartie cap.', '2004-10-23 06:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(970504, 112821, 24983, '<td valign="top">excellent still life has all the right ingredients.</td>', 'excellent still life has all the right ingredients.', '2004-10-23 06:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(970505, 114240, 24983, '<td valign="top">so you were another one of us who played around during boring lessons, a good memory.6</td>', 'so you were another one of us who played around during boring lessons, a good memory.6', '2004-10-23 06:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(970509, 114072, 26679, '<td valign="top">You have probably received feedback n the heart, shadow, copying an earlier challenge. - I like it; its a good take on the idea, and works here.<br/> <br/>The pencil lets down the composition for me; it is much stronger than the delicate construction of the spectacles, and therefore rather than balancing the images, tends to take over.  If the pencil were at more of an angle this may help.<br/></td>', 'You have probably received feedback n the heart, shadow, copying an earlier challenge. - I like it; its a good take on the idea, and works here. The pencil lets down the composition for me; it is much stronger than the delicate construction of the spectacles, and therefore rather than balancing the images, tends to take over.  If the pencil were at more of an angle this may help.', '2004-10-23 06:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(970510, 112899, 24983, '<td valign="top">I like this shot simple and I like the direct gaze, The highlights seem to be blown out,. 5</td>', 'I like this shot simple and I like the direct gaze, The highlights seem to be blown out,. 5', '2004-10-23 06:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(970514, 114248, 24983, '<td valign="top">Some mightnot get the message in this shot. It is a little static I think there is too much in the image perhaps coming in on the california map and the world globes would make a stronger and more interesting composition.</td>', 'Some mightnot get the message in this shot. It is a little static I think there is too much in the image perhaps coming in on the california map and the world globes would make a stronger and more interesting composition.', '2004-10-23 06:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
