(970517, 113904, 24983, '<td valign="top">The diagonal composition took my eye, its a strong image but to me says nothing about school perhaps a text book would have been a better idea to tie it together rather than the pad. 4</td>', 'The diagonal composition took my eye, its a strong image but to me says nothing about school perhaps a text book would have been a better idea to tie it together rather than the pad. 4', '2004-10-23 07:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
