(970528, 113999, 24983, '<td valign="top">This has the makigs of a wonderful shot, if only you had been in front and shot from a lower angle, for me back of heads are boring. there is just so much scope and images to be had here. the wonderful expressions on theirlittle faces . Ifvthe opportunity is there go back and get the real shot.</td>', 'This has the makigs of a wonderful shot, if only you had been in front and shot from a lower angle, for me back of heads are boring. there is just so much scope and images to be had here. the wonderful expressions on theirlittle faces . Ifvthe opportunity is there go back and get the real shot.', '2004-10-23 07:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(970531, 113476, 24983, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time with this image. I see your point It is a creativly thought out image but I think it is let down technically. So what would I have done, Give it about 1or2 stops lessexposure {use the compensation button} it would build updetail in the seat and chain and darken down the background giving I think a more dramatic interpretation.</td>', 'I have a hard time with this image. I see your point It is a creativly thought out image but I think it is let down technically. So what would I have done, Give it about 1or2 stops lessexposure {use the compensation button} it would build updetail in the seat and chain and darken down the background giving I think a more dramatic interpretation.', '2004-10-23 07:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(970533, 113653, 24983, '<td valign="top">good idea but there is too much in this image I would have concentrated on the old blue desk I guess therre may be some carving on it and the side light from the window would enhance this,.</td>', 'good idea but there is too much in this image I would have concentrated on the old blue desk I guess therre may be some carving on it and the side light from the window would enhance this,.', '2004-10-23 07:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
