(970588, 114035, 26679, '<td valign="top">Lovely image a building. The picture is well composed and balanced. However this is an international challange, and without the tittle I would not have known that this was a school.<br/> <br/>You have obviously kept exactly to the instruction and I recognise and reward this. My observation is to try and think of what other may see if they were raised and live in other countries. Or add something else to the image portray the message.<br/> <br/>As a photograph it is beautiful, and I can''t believe you have been asked to validate this. <br/></td>', 'Lovely image a building. The picture is well composed and balanced. However this is an international challange, and without the tittle I would not have known that this was a school. You have obviously kept exactly to the instruction and I recognise and reward this. My observation is to try and think of what other may see if they were raised and live in other countries. Or add something else to the image portray the message. As a photograph it is beautiful, and I can''t believe you have been asked to validate this. ', '2004-10-23 08:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
