(970685, 113840, 16488, '<td valign="top">This image compels one to look at it awhile.  I like the rich colors of the items you chose.  Wish the Roll was just as antique looking as the other items, though.  It also strikes me as odd that your list of students isn''t in alphabetic order...<br/>Composition is pleasing.  Lighting well handled.</td>', 'This image compels one to look at it awhile.  I like the rich colors of the items you chose.  Wish the Roll was just as antique looking as the other items, though.  It also strikes me as odd that your list of students isn''t in alphabetic order...Composition is pleasing.  Lighting well handled.', '2004-10-23 10:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
