(973055, 114016, 18073, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image, my favourite of the challenge by quite a long way.  Great composure, lighting and beautiful pose and expression on the little one.  Good luck with this one.</td>', 'Fantastic image, my favourite of the challenge by quite a long way.  Great composure, lighting and beautiful pose and expression on the little one.  Good luck with this one.', '2004-10-25 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
