(973066, 114243, 27482, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge, I´d be surprised to see this anywhere but in the top 10.</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge, I´d be surprised to see this anywhere but in the top 10.', '2004-10-25 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(973073, 113227, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awful title...  I would not want to browse a website and suddenly come across a picture of me I didn´t know of calling me fat so try to show a little more taste next time.  Anyway the shot is just very very average, hard to give it anything but a 5.</td>', 'Awful title...  I would not want to browse a website and suddenly come across a picture of me I didn´t know of calling me fat so try to show a little more taste next time.  Anyway the shot is just very very average, hard to give it anything but a 5.', '2004-10-25 14:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(973081, 113510, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wrong shutter speed IMO.  It´s either too fast or too slow.  You should have tried to freeze the action more or do just the opposite and try a panning kind of shot focusing on just the head of someone.  This just looks like camera shake and poor focus.  3</td>', 'Wrong shutter speed IMO.  It´s either too fast or too slow.  You should have tried to freeze the action more or do just the opposite and try a panning kind of shot focusing on just the head of someone.  This just looks like camera shake and poor focus.  3', '2004-10-25 14:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(973106, 113784, 28396, '<td valign="top">Nice Look.</td>', 'Nice Look.', '2004-10-25 14:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(973138, 113542, 4517, '<td valign="top">I`m  guessing the wrong challenge :)</td>', 'I`m  guessing the wrong challenge :)', '2004-10-25 15:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(973150, 114043, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good idea, poor execution.  The coin is a bit out of focus and the lighting from the side isn´t helping.  Photographing something that reflects light is tricky though and this isn´t a bad effort, but neither a great one.  Next time try using a bigger lightsource, or shielding the coin with a transparent reflector, like this -&gt;  //www.bhphotovideo.com/bnh/controller/home?O=productlist&amp;A=details&amp;Q=&amp;sku=270872&amp;is=REG<br/> <br/>I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Good idea, poor execution.  The coin is a bit out of focus and the lighting from the side isn´t helping.  Photographing something that reflects light is tricky though and this isn´t a bad effort, but neither a great one.  Next time try using a bigger lightsource, or shielding the coin with a transparent reflector, like this ->  //www.bhphotovideo.com/bnh/controller/home?O=productlist&A=details&Q=&sku=270872&is=REG I gave it a 5.', '2004-10-25 15:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(973194, 114028, 25218, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid colors, but I don''t like the angle much. It''s a little unsettling, like everything is going to slide off.</td>', 'Nice vivid colors, but I don''t like the angle much. It''s a little unsettling, like everything is going to slide off.', '2004-10-25 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(973199, 114247, 25218, '<td valign="top">It''s just a little too blurry, and, ouch!</td>', 'It''s just a little too blurry, and, ouch!', '2004-10-25 16:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(973203, 114021, 25218, '<td valign="top">this is very evocative - I love the lighting</td>', 'this is very evocative - I love the lighting', '2004-10-25 16:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
