(973736, 113550, 21069, '<td valign="top">how this brings back memories :p - maybe the clothing is sort of not cool well no teenager would wear that would they? - a bit try hardey if you ask me <br/>nice use of the border by the way - without the subject in the picture and maybe just a few empty spray cans left behind and some barb wire fence fragments would make this shoot more believable and interesting - how does this shoot look in colour?<br/> <br/>Im giving you a [4] but you leave nothing up to the imagination in this shoot which i would of loved to see, the title is the only thing which really relates this to the challenge, i believe this because teenagers like to hang in groups when doing this sort of thing and do it after school not during school<br/> <br/>i just don''t see how this really relates to school - sorry</td>', 'how this brings back memories :p - maybe the clothing is sort of not cool well no teenager would wear that would they? - a bit try hardey if you ask me nice use of the border by the way - without the subject in the picture and maybe just a few empty spray cans left behind and some barb wire fence fragments would make this shoot more believable and interesting - how does this shoot look in colour? Im giving you a [4] but you leave nothing up to the imagination in this shoot which i would of loved to see, the title is the only thing which really relates this to the challenge, i believe this because teenagers like to hang in groups when doing this sort of thing and do it after school not during school i just don''t see how this really relates to school - sorry', '2004-10-25 22:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(973743, 114035, 21069, '<td valign="top">Nice shoot - first [10] in this challenge really captures what i believe to be the foundation of this challenge - my pick for #1</td>', 'Nice shoot - first [10] in this challenge really captures what i believe to be the foundation of this challenge - my pick for #1', '2004-10-25 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(973781, 113833, 12751, '<td valign="top">Where did this guy learn to hold a pencil? Isn''t this a built-in excel function?  Not exactly a tough test.  Oh, wait, I am supposed to rate the photo.  Photo isn''t bad.</td>', 'Where did this guy learn to hold a pencil? Isn''t this a built-in excel function?  Not exactly a tough test.  Oh, wait, I am supposed to rate the photo.  Photo isn''t bad.', '2004-10-25 23:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(973797, 113978, 12751, '<td valign="top">Engineering is neither trendy nor chic.  I should know, I am an engineer.  As for the photo, I think a sharper focus on the calculator would have been better.</td>', 'Engineering is neither trendy nor chic.  I should know, I am an engineer.  As for the photo, I think a sharper focus on the calculator would have been better.', '2004-10-25 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(973826, 113860, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea and good shot.  But why the garbage right behind?  The context is what''s missing: I was looking all over your shot for signs this was a classroom but it doesn''t look like one.</td>', 'Good idea and good shot.  But why the garbage right behind?  The context is what''s missing: I was looking all over your shot for signs this was a classroom but it doesn''t look like one.', '2004-10-26 00:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(973829, 114211, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I wish I couldn''t see a white linen backdrop.  A dark background might have worked better, or even the view outside a window, especially if it looked classroomish.</td>', 'Great shot, but I wish I couldn''t see a white linen backdrop.  A dark background might have worked better, or even the view outside a window, especially if it looked classroomish.', '2004-10-26 00:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(973833, 113767, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the focus, but it''s not sharp.</td>', 'I like the composition and the focus, but it''s not sharp.', '2004-10-26 00:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(973975, 114250, 23251, '<td valign="top">I hope this does well in School Days, pity you can''t enter it in music as well. Great concept for the challenge. My highest rated shot.</td>', 'I hope this does well in School Days, pity you can''t enter it in music as well. Great concept for the challenge. My highest rated shot.', '2004-10-26 04:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(974033, 112714, 24128, '<td valign="top">I''m not really 100% sure what this pic is supposed to be about, if it''s a ''sign of the time'' protest type pic then it would certainly benefit from a complimentary background - maybe newspaper headlines or similar, although even with that in mind I don''t understand the inclusion of the camera</td>', 'I''m not really 100% sure what this pic is supposed to be about, if it''s a ''sign of the time'' protest type pic then it would certainly benefit from a complimentary background - maybe newspaper headlines or similar, although even with that in mind I don''t understand the inclusion of the camera', '2004-10-26 06:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(974034, 113542, 24128, '<td valign="top">not really sure what the relevance is to ''school days'', interesting pic though :)</td>', 'not really sure what the relevance is to ''school days'', interesting pic though :)', '2004-10-26 06:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(974035, 114198, 24128, '<td valign="top">it would really help if there was even just a hint of a smile on her face, alternatively the look would go well with her handing over a number of papers implying that she had done her lines (or similar)</td>', 'it would really help if there was even just a hint of a smile on her face, alternatively the look would go well with her handing over a number of papers implying that she had done her lines (or similar)', '2004-10-26 06:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(974036, 114206, 24128, '<td valign="top">love the pic - now you just need to get dpc to add the sound ;)</td>', 'love the pic - now you just need to get dpc to add the sound ;)', '2004-10-26 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(974040, 112910, 24128, '<td valign="top">this would be much nicer with a deeper dof, i find the limited focus distracting</td>', 'this would be much nicer with a deeper dof, i find the limited focus distracting', '2004-10-26 06:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(974060, 113351, 27482, '<td valign="top">The backround is very uniteresting so I would have gotten in closer, but that is just IMO.  6</td>', 'The backround is very uniteresting so I would have gotten in closer, but that is just IMO.  6', '2004-10-26 07:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(974065, 113831, 27482, '<td valign="top">I can´t help but wonder who he (or she) was kicking.  Anyway, one of the best in the challenge but I can´t give it a 10 either.</td>', 'I can´t help but wonder who he (or she) was kicking.  Anyway, one of the best in the challenge but I can´t give it a 10 either.', '2004-10-26 07:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(974067, 112845, 27482, '<td valign="top">The sky could have been nicer and it´s very flat, could use a contrast boost.  All in this just gives me an impression of a tourist using a p&amp;s snapping away to then later show relatives at home a funky looking school they saw on their trip.  Don´t get me wrong, it´s not horrible by a long shot, but hardly a breathtaking shot.  I gave it a 5.</td>', 'The sky could have been nicer and it´s very flat, could use a contrast boost.  All in this just gives me an impression of a tourist using a p&s snapping away to then later show relatives at home a funky looking school they saw on their trip.  Don´t get me wrong, it´s not horrible by a long shot, but hardly a breathtaking shot.  I gave it a 5.', '2004-10-26 07:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(974068, 114247, 27482, '<td valign="top">Fitting title and I am not going to be one that is "shocked" at this image.  I´ll say this though that it looks like you had use for a tripod cause you got some serious camera shake going on.  Also, using a tripod you could have used an even longer shutterspeed and captured more movement of the board giving a sense of speed to the board.  I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Fitting title and I am not going to be one that is "shocked" at this image.  I´ll say this though that it looks like you had use for a tripod cause you got some serious camera shake going on.  Also, using a tripod you could have used an even longer shutterspeed and captured more movement of the board giving a sense of speed to the board.  I gave it a 5.', '2004-10-26 07:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(974069, 113916, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love it.  Just a downside for me personally, I would have liked to see more pencils up in the right corner instead of that gray backround.  I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Great shot, I love it.  Just a downside for me personally, I would have liked to see more pencils up in the right corner instead of that gray backround.  I gave it a 9.', '2004-10-26 07:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(974071, 113860, 16352, '<td valign="top">A very difficult shot to expose and has achieved it well. If there was the time I would have taken another with a far wider aperture to have lost some dof in the background. Try cropping out the cupboard (I think it is) on the left. It competes with the light colour of the jumper and is off vertical.</td>', 'A very difficult shot to expose and has achieved it well. If there was the time I would have taken another with a far wider aperture to have lost some dof in the background. Try cropping out the cupboard (I think it is) on the left. It competes with the light colour of the jumper and is off vertical.', '2004-10-26 07:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(974072, 114016, 16352, '<td valign="top">Beautifully exposed and a lovely use of space.  I would like to see it with the (sister) cropped out. The main character would still be far enough to one side for her to be looking into the centre of the picture. Would like to know if it was a "grabbed shot" or set up. If it was grabbed it was great. If it was set up - I would like to see some of the others.</td>', 'Beautifully exposed and a lovely use of space.  I would like to see it with the (sister) cropped out. The main character would still be far enough to one side for her to be looking into the centre of the picture. Would like to know if it was a "grabbed shot" or set up. If it was grabbed it was great. If it was set up - I would like to see some of the others.', '2004-10-26 07:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(974074, 114191, 16352, '<td valign="top">I like this and dark skin tones with lots of white in the picture are always a nightmare to expose. This was almost spot on. I like the obvious low light from the right side but find the big shadow distracting. A much tighter crop on the left and the top would leave all the elements still there - and as long as the plate is still there along with the shadows of the page there is still enough information to show the dramatic effect of the lighting.</td>', 'I like this and dark skin tones with lots of white in the picture are always a nightmare to expose. This was almost spot on. I like the obvious low light from the right side but find the big shadow distracting. A much tighter crop on the left and the top would leave all the elements still there - and as long as the plate is still there along with the shadows of the page there is still enough information to show the dramatic effect of the lighting.', '2004-10-26 07:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(974076, 113861, 27482, '<td valign="top">One of the rare instances that lens flare actually helps the shot.  Otherwise just an average shot, not good but far from bad either.</td>', 'One of the rare instances that lens flare actually helps the shot.  Otherwise just an average shot, not good but far from bad either.', '2004-10-26 07:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(974078, 113904, 16352, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of picture I would have chosen when looking for photos to head artricles for publication BUT the pencil would have been too central.  I have moved the pencil up in Photoshop and left more space in the bottom left. It would then have great commercial prospects and I think unbalances the picture so it gives it more "PUNCH"</td>', 'This is the sort of picture I would have chosen when looking for photos to head artricles for publication BUT the pencil would have been too central.  I have moved the pencil up in Photoshop and left more space in the bottom left. It would then have great commercial prospects and I think unbalances the picture so it gives it more "PUNCH"', '2004-10-26 07:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(974081, 113542, 16352, '<td valign="top">I did think of school days when I saw this - specifically school holidays. I suspect some may say "why is that school days".....Ignore them. My only problem is the footprints do not look like a childs footprints and that is where I would heave it out in a competition. I am not saying it is NOT a childs footprint. Maybe a shell or similar would have just put the scale into it. Love the aspect and the high horizon. Reflections are great.</td>', 'I did think of school days when I saw this - specifically school holidays. I suspect some may say "why is that school days".....Ignore them. My only problem is the footprints do not look like a childs footprints and that is where I would heave it out in a competition. I am not saying it is NOT a childs footprint. Maybe a shell or similar would have just put the scale into it. Love the aspect and the high horizon. Reflections are great.', '2004-10-26 08:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(974082, 114059, 16352, '<td valign="top">I love these - This should be in a newspaper - it should go with a story - I don''t know what story but it should be held in a library. It can be cropped in a multitude of ways and still be great. Boy in back row 2nd from right is a character in himself.<br/>Love it</td>', 'I love these - This should be in a newspaper - it should go with a story - I don''t know what story but it should be held in a library. It can be cropped in a multitude of ways and still be great. Boy in back row 2nd from right is a character in himself.Love it', '2004-10-26 08:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(974107, 114247, 27205, '<td valign="top">nasty !  pity about the quality but like the concept.</td>', 'nasty !  pity about the quality but like the concept.', '2004-10-26 08:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(974137, 114195, 16352, '<td valign="top">At first I could not make out what this had to do with the title school days......ME STUPID ENGLISH.....Then I realised what it was nd I liked it</td>', 'At first I could not make out what this had to do with the title school days......ME STUPID ENGLISH.....Then I realised what it was nd I liked it', '2004-10-26 09:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(974142, 114251, 16352, '<td valign="top">I like the play on words - I like the unusual angle - I like the framing of the building between the 2 pieces of vegetation.  The only thing that spoils it is the converging vertcles. I accept that some people don''t mind them or they can even be exaggerated for effect. I don''t think these converge enough to get away with it. Excellent exposure though an an effective picture.</td>', 'I like the play on words - I like the unusual angle - I like the framing of the building between the 2 pieces of vegetation.  The only thing that spoils it is the converging vertcles. I accept that some people don''t mind them or they can even be exaggerated for effect. I don''t think these converge enough to get away with it. Excellent exposure though an an effective picture.', '2004-10-26 09:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(974144, 114170, 16352, '<td valign="top">Really good POV. It lifts the picture out of what could have been an ordinary shot.</td>', 'Really good POV. It lifts the picture out of what could have been an ordinary shot.', '2004-10-26 09:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(974150, 114032, 16352, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. If I were still selecting pictures for publication I think I would consider using this. My only thought is that it lacks "punch" and a the woodburner seems slightly out of focus and it seems that is where the focus should be. There seemed to be a lack of black. I put it into photoshop and moved the sliders around - it makes a huge difference. I would be happy to email my changes and see what you feel. Definately has commercial potential<br/></td>', 'I like the composition. If I were still selecting pictures for publication I think I would consider using this. My only thought is that it lacks "punch" and a the woodburner seems slightly out of focus and it seems that is where the focus should be. There seemed to be a lack of black. I put it into photoshop and moved the sliders around - it makes a huge difference. I would be happy to email my changes and see what you feel. Definately has commercial potential', '2004-10-26 09:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(974156, 114050, 16352, '<td valign="top">Really good composition - I would also like to see it "back to front" focus on face - books out of focus. Great use of DOF. Looking at it from a commercial point of view it is certainly one I would have used - there is just enough space foreground left side for some text</td>', 'Really good composition - I would also like to see it "back to front" focus on face - books out of focus. Great use of DOF. Looking at it from a commercial point of view it is certainly one I would have used - there is just enough space foreground left side for some text', '2004-10-26 09:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(974160, 113785, 16352, '<td valign="top">This looks as it has just been pulled from the 1960''s<br/>Would make an excellent illustrative picture to go with an education/childcare article and on I would have selected. I adjusted the curve in PS to make the whites - white and that really pulled it out.</td>', 'This looks as it has just been pulled from the 1960''sWould make an excellent illustrative picture to go with an education/childcare article and on I would have selected. I adjusted the curve in PS to make the whites - white and that really pulled it out.', '2004-10-26 09:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(974166, 114096, 16352, '<td valign="top">The composition is very good and isolates the subject well. Black and white is so hard and very subjective. I changed the curve in PS and it immediately gave it more impact - <br/>I like this picture very much</td>', 'The composition is very good and isolates the subject well. Black and white is so hard and very subjective. I changed the curve in PS and it immediately gave it more impact - I like this picture very much', '2004-10-26 10:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(974171, 113895, 16352, '<td valign="top">Perfectly exposed - whites white - blacks black - beautiful saturation in the colours.<br/>Lots of commercial potential.<br/>If I was still selecting for publication I would use this but crop on the right to get rid of the white. Although it means losing the back of his head - his face is still dominent and strong enough to crry the picture</td>', 'Perfectly exposed - whites white - blacks black - beautiful saturation in the colours.Lots of commercial potential.If I was still selecting for publication I would use this but crop on the right to get rid of the white. Although it means losing the back of his head - his face is still dominent and strong enough to crry the picture', '2004-10-26 10:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(974177, 113389, 16352, '<td valign="top">My first thoughts were that it looked like a good product shot and had commercial potential - but the triple shadow particularly visible on the calculator spoils it. A soft diffused light top left to get rid of all but the main shadow would make a huge difference. I removed the shadow in PS and it does let the eye concentrate on the other components. <br/>I would like to see an original print. I think that as this would be good commercially - I would think !what is the important part" For me the "texas instruments" text. It seems slightly out of focus and I would get that part pin sharp.</td>', 'My first thoughts were that it looked like a good product shot and had commercial potential - but the triple shadow particularly visible on the calculator spoils it. A soft diffused light top left to get rid of all but the main shadow would make a huge difference. I removed the shadow in PS and it does let the eye concentrate on the other components. I would like to see an original print. I think that as this would be good commercially - I would think !what is the important part" For me the "texas instruments" text. It seems slightly out of focus and I would get that part pin sharp.', '2004-10-26 10:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(974181, 114242, 16352, '<td valign="top">I love the colours - the POV and the slight disorder of the chair and 1 book in the otherwise perfectly ordered library. It lacks only one thing (which may show in the original hi-res pic) and that is the exact point of focus. The logical point would be the chair but it seems slightly fuzzy. I found my eyes going up and down the image looking for the precise point.</td>', 'I love the colours - the POV and the slight disorder of the chair and 1 book in the otherwise perfectly ordered library. It lacks only one thing (which may show in the original hi-res pic) and that is the exact point of focus. The logical point would be the chair but it seems slightly fuzzy. I found my eyes going up and down the image looking for the precise point.', '2004-10-26 10:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(974189, 114182, 16352, '<td valign="top">I really can''t make my mind up.<br/>I see what you are getting at. The rushing in the morning - drinking - eating etc.<br/>The only problem is the light colour.<br/>Warm colours like this give the impression of slowness and calm and that contradicts (I think) the principle of what you are trying to get across.<br/>I have changed the colour balance in photoshop - to give it a daylight shift and also a flourescent shift and it seems to give it that sense of urgency.<br/>Was your camera set up for auto-white balance?<br/></td>', 'I really can''t make my mind up.I see what you are getting at. The rushing in the morning - drinking - eating etc.The only problem is the light colour.Warm colours like this give the impression of slowness and calm and that contradicts (I think) the principle of what you are trying to get across.I have changed the colour balance in photoshop - to give it a daylight shift and also a flourescent shift and it seems to give it that sense of urgency.Was your camera set up for auto-white balance?', '2004-10-26 10:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(974209, 114141, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit oversharpened but other than that, not a bad portrait but hardly exceptional either.</td>', 'Looks a bit oversharpened but other than that, not a bad portrait but hardly exceptional either.', '2004-10-26 10:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(974210, 113978, 16352, '<td valign="top">At last - one with imagination. I had a bellyful of pencils and apples. Great commercial potential - the only problem is the slight burn-out bottom right and it would be nice to not see the shadow of the left forearm.<br/>When I was selecting pictures for publication I would have this on the possible/probable pile</td>', 'At last - one with imagination. I had a bellyful of pencils and apples. Great commercial potential - the only problem is the slight burn-out bottom right and it would be nice to not see the shadow of the left forearm.When I was selecting pictures for publication I would have this on the possible/probable pile', '2004-10-26 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(974231, 114170, 28380, '<td valign="top">Brings back memories....I like that it is not a staged shot.</td>', 'Brings back memories....I like that it is not a staged shot.', '2004-10-26 11:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(974249, 113528, 11892, '<td valign="top">Invert!!!!!! fuck</td>', 'Invert!!!!!! fuck', '2004-10-26 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(974283, 113839, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better if you had cropped into a more panorama shape instead of the 3:2 but good shot, one of my favorites.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better if you had cropped into a more panorama shape instead of the 3:2 but good shot, one of my favorites.', '2004-10-26 11:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(974288, 114242, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool, great to see things from a mouses viewpoint.  The highlights from the lights don´t help however, might have worked better if you had cropped them out.</td>', 'Cool, great to see things from a mouses viewpoint.  The highlights from the lights don´t help however, might have worked better if you had cropped them out.', '2004-10-26 11:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(974296, 114203, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s a bit cluttered, the apple, the black toy dog and the book + sheet and pencil, your eye wanders a whole lot.  It´s a good idea though to break the pencil in frustration and if you had focused on that IMO you would have a killer shot.  I like it though so I gave it a 7.</td>', 'It´s a bit cluttered, the apple, the black toy dog and the book + sheet and pencil, your eye wanders a whole lot.  It´s a good idea though to break the pencil in frustration and if you had focused on that IMO you would have a killer shot.  I like it though so I gave it a 7.', '2004-10-26 11:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(974315, 113710, 18157, '<td valign="top">Looks like the back hall at my old school. Funny.</td>', 'Looks like the back hall at my old school. Funny.', '2004-10-26 11:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(974332, 113227, 18157, '<td valign="top">Why would you choose that title? Pretty rude. Seems to me you only entered it so you could give it that title. Is it because you have personal issues with her?</td>', 'Why would you choose that title? Pretty rude. Seems to me you only entered it so you could give it that title. Is it because you have personal issues with her?', '2004-10-26 12:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
