(974727, 113588, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the tree in this composition does you any favors.</td>', 'I don''t think the tree in this composition does you any favors.', '2004-10-26 17:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(974731, 112911, 18799, '<td valign="top">While this does represent the education experience and I can relate to it, the photo suffers a bit technically.  The image could be sharper, there is are a number of blown highlights, and you committed the cardinal sin of chopping someone''s  head in half.  All that being said, I bet it was fun to shoot.</td>', 'While this does represent the education experience and I can relate to it, the photo suffers a bit technically.  The image could be sharper, there is are a number of blown highlights, and you committed the cardinal sin of chopping someone''s  head in half.  All that being said, I bet it was fun to shoot.', '2004-10-26 17:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(974734, 113502, 18799, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of good sentiment in this picture.  What hurts it for me is the flowers in front.</td>', 'There is a lot of good sentiment in this picture.  What hurts it for me is the flowers in front.', '2004-10-26 17:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(974739, 113048, 18799, '<td valign="top">FIELD TRIP!!  This is a fond recollection of education to me.  While technically, the photo has some flaws such as blown highlights, the connection wins out.  8</td>', 'FIELD TRIP!!  This is a fond recollection of education to me.  While technically, the photo has some flaws such as blown highlights, the connection wins out.  8', '2004-10-26 17:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
