(974956, 114035, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene and shot.  However, thee''s a lot of JPEG noise in the sky--make sure you are using as little compression as possible.  Also, there''s a halo around the building and above the horizon either from oversharpening or other editing.  It''s not terriibly noticeable to the average quick voter, but when you try to enjoy the scene at length, it gets in the way.  Still excellent shot and one of my top picks for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Edit: Sorry, I just noticed my typo! (Hold rather than Halo!)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-27 11:41:27.</i></td>', 'Very nice scene and shot.  However, thee''s a lot of JPEG noise in the sky--make sure you are using as little compression as possible.  Also, there''s a halo around the building and above the horizon either from oversharpening or other editing.  It''s not terriibly noticeable to the average quick voter, but when you try to enjoy the scene at length, it gets in the way.  Still excellent shot and one of my top picks for this challenge. Edit: Sorry, I just noticed my typo! (Hold rather than Halo!)', '2004-10-26 21:05:28.000000', '2004-10-27 12:41:27.000000', 1),
(974957, 113831, 12253, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective and well done.  One of my top picks to ribbon.</td>', 'Simple but effective and well done.  One of my top picks to ribbon.', '2004-10-26 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(974958, 113364, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is the perfect school days shot.  It could be better technically, but not emotionally (even though I don''t know the girl, I can see her pride and the teachers compassion.  So I rank it at the top of this challenge.</td>', 'This is the perfect school days shot.  It could be better technically, but not emotionally (even though I don''t know the girl, I can see her pride and the teachers compassion.  So I rank it at the top of this challenge.', '2004-10-26 21:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
