(975054, 114141, 28309, '<td valign="top">Great expression and framing. Only minuses are a little jagged from oversharpening (or downsampling for web, I suppose), and the sweater is too solid black, no detail in it.</td>', 'Great expression and framing. Only minuses are a little jagged from oversharpening (or downsampling for web, I suppose), and the sweater is too solid black, no detail in it.', '2004-10-26 22:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
