(975199, 113832, 9906, '<td valign="top">OK  You got me.  This is the first shot in (IMHO) a very dull set of challenge shots that made me stop and say ''wow''.  Great depth, great tonality.  Love the mist and leading lines (path into the distance) and the simplicity of the shot.  Without hitting us in the head with the challenge theme, you hit the challenge theme right on the head!<br/>TC</td>', 'OK  You got me.  This is the first shot in (IMHO) a very dull set of challenge shots that made me stop and say ''wow''.  Great depth, great tonality.  Love the mist and leading lines (path into the distance) and the simplicity of the shot.  Without hitting us in the head with the challenge theme, you hit the challenge theme right on the head!TC', '2004-10-26 23:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(975200, 114210, 19936, '<td valign="top">Oh yes they were, at least when I was a teenager!  Now I like the real thing.  Good choice of subjects as Cliffs Notes were a mainstay in most schools.</td>', 'Oh yes they were, at least when I was a teenager!  Now I like the real thing.  Good choice of subjects as Cliffs Notes were a mainstay in most schools.', '2004-10-26 23:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
