(975212, 114198, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful capture.  Some may not like the lighting but I think it adds to the photo.  Only shadow I think distracts is the one on the wall.  Good job.  BTW - she does not look all that excited about giving the teacher the apple!  LOL</td>', 'This is a wonderful capture.  Some may not like the lighting but I think it adds to the photo.  Only shadow I think distracts is the one on the wall.  Good job.  BTW - she does not look all that excited about giving the teacher the apple!  LOL', '2004-10-26 23:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(975214, 113318, 19936, '<td valign="top">Very good mood projected here.  I think we all can relate to going back and looking through the yearbook.  Great capture and in this case I think the grain/noise works.</td>', 'Very good mood projected here.  I think we all can relate to going back and looking through the yearbook.  Great capture and in this case I think the grain/noise works.', '2004-10-26 23:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
