(975249, 113927, 24511, '<td valign="top">Three poses, three positions, great triangle composition.  I gave this photo a 10 for brightness, story telling, and the exellent message for us all that education begins and ends outside the classroom.  These three children are quiet yet curious and unique in their characters, what they are looking at and how they seem to view the world in different sitting, climbing and standing positions. Thanks a lot.</td>', 'Three poses, three positions, great triangle composition.  I gave this photo a 10 for brightness, story telling, and the exellent message for us all that education begins and ends outside the classroom.  These three children are quiet yet curious and unique in their characters, what they are looking at and how they seem to view the world in different sitting, climbing and standing positions. Thanks a lot.', '2004-10-27 00:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(975255, 112614, 16829, '<td valign="top">The pose and composition are good. While the relative lighting is wonderful, the absolute lighting is so dark it leaves too much undetailed area. IMO!</td>', 'The pose and composition are good. While the relative lighting is wonderful, the absolute lighting is so dark it leaves too much undetailed area. IMO!', '2004-10-27 00:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
