(975308, 114191, 25272, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank all of you for your comments; they were really helpful. Strange though as this may sound, I never paid much attention to the distracting shadows. By the time you brought it to my attention, I had crossed the point of no return. Nevertheless, I reopened the image in Photoshop and replaced the current background with a solid black backdrop. I also ''bleached'' the whites in the image to make the pages, head scarf, and eyes stand out. I am much happier with the result now, and it''s all thanks to your advice.</td>', 'I would like to thank all of you for your comments; they were really helpful. Strange though as this may sound, I never paid much attention to the distracting shadows. By the time you brought it to my attention, I had crossed the point of no return. Nevertheless, I reopened the image in Photoshop and replaced the current background with a solid black backdrop. I also ''bleached'' the whites in the image to make the pages, head scarf, and eyes stand out. I am much happier with the result now, and it''s all thanks to your advice.', '2004-10-27 01:09:05.000000', NULL, 0),
