(975345, 114032, 9906, '<td valign="top">I knew that this shot would be rediculously underrated, but this is horrible.  You should have been at least in the top 10 percent, not way down here near the basement.  Please keep up the good work and don''t let this first entry get ya down.  Like I said below, soft focus is NOT appreciated here like it should be.  If you look at any fine art b/w magazines or shows, you''ll see shots like this all the time.  DPC, as fine a site as it is does NOT represent the world of fine photography...<br/>Yours (hopefully for some time)<br/>TC</td>', 'I knew that this shot would be rediculously underrated, but this is horrible.  You should have been at least in the top 10 percent, not way down here near the basement.  Please keep up the good work and don''t let this first entry get ya down.  Like I said below, soft focus is NOT appreciated here like it should be.  If you look at any fine art b/w magazines or shows, you''ll see shots like this all the time.  DPC, as fine a site as it is does NOT represent the world of fine photography...Yours (hopefully for some time)TC', '2004-10-27 01:17:50.000000', NULL, 0),
