(975446, 114123, 27593, '<td valign="top">The challenge said -Take us back to the "good ole golden rule" days! Photograph something that represents education.<br/>With the war and Pres. Bush talking about how he prays etc, and basically being a God fearing man, and many other rulers for that matter,  that coupled with on how they seem to justify the breaking of a commandment, Thou shalt not kill, is where the pic came to mind. I think many people in power arent necessarily idiots (see The Complete Idiots Guide to the Bible) but act like them non the same.  Im a fairly recent born again Christian. Just started taking pics a few weeks ago. Also just finished reading about exposure,  etc. Im thrilled I didnt finish last. Im a plumber hence my screen name is plumber711, those numbers mean something to me. I noticed that I received 11 votes of 7. My avg, vote was 4.070 ( 7 plus 4 equals 11). Im writing a book, it may be the ramblings of a lunatic or it may .. I almost un-submitted  this, but then again, what the hay. Thanks for ALL your comments, I really appreciate it. Also am very pleased to have come across this site and read all the comments said, good bad or indifferent about all the pics. I wasnt pleased with the glare, took about 40 shots and the transparency was only how I wanted it on this one. Thanks again.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-31 10:54:04.</i></td>', 'The challenge said -Take us back to the "good ole golden rule" days! Photograph something that represents education.With the war and Pres. Bush talking about how he prays etc, and basically being a God fearing man, and many other rulers for that matter,  that coupled with on how they seem to justify the breaking of a commandment, Thou shalt not kill, is where the pic came to mind. I think many people in power arent necessarily idiots (see The Complete Idiots Guide to the Bible) but act like them non the same.  Im a fairly recent born again Christian. Just started taking pics a few weeks ago. Also just finished reading about exposure,  etc. Im thrilled I didnt finish last. Im a plumber hence my screen name is plumber711, those numbers mean something to me. I noticed that I received 11 votes of 7. My avg, vote was 4.070 ( 7 plus 4 equals 11). Im writing a book, it may be the ramblings of a lunatic or it may .. I almost un-submitted  this, but then again, what the hay. Thanks for ALL your comments, I really appreciate it. Also am very pleased to have come across this site and read all the comments said, good bad or indifferent about all the pics. I wasnt pleased with the glare, took about 40 shots and the transparency was only how I wanted it on this one. Thanks again.', '2004-10-27 01:55:32.000000', '2004-10-31 10:54:04.000000', 0),
