(976023, 113227, 24925, '<td valign="top">It takes a real man to make such a statement.  I envy your manliness.  Compassion and sensitivity is for sissies.  Long live unrealistic expectations!  Spoon-feed me, 30-second commercial, as I adopt your values and worship your sales pitch!  I will fit your mold to make you rich!  Your models should be revered! Fat chicks should be humiliated! Thank you, Revlon, Victoria''s Secret and Maxim Magazine!  Thank you Hollywood and Milan!  Show me Truth! Liberate my senses! I am important! I am worthy!  I am customer!  I AM!<br/> <br/>My rant is over...I don''t like your photo.  I hope you take people''s comments to heart.</td>', 'It takes a real man to make such a statement.  I envy your manliness.  Compassion and sensitivity is for sissies.  Long live unrealistic expectations!  Spoon-feed me, 30-second commercial, as I adopt your values and worship your sales pitch!  I will fit your mold to make you rich!  Your models should be revered! Fat chicks should be humiliated! Thank you, Revlon, Victoria''s Secret and Maxim Magazine!  Thank you Hollywood and Milan!  Show me Truth! Liberate my senses! I am important! I am worthy!  I am customer!  I AM! My rant is over...I don''t like your photo.  I hope you take people''s comments to heart.', '2004-10-27 10:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
