(976123, 113464, 20056, '<td valign="top">Ok, maybe this picture deserve some explanation :)<br/>The relation with the challenge "school days" is the graduation hat, can You see it?<br/> <br/>I wanted to make some funny point about graduation, after studying 20 years of your life something You end up working in something totally different... I feel graduation events at schools are like clowns in circus... I did not have a clown at home but I had something similar: my SantaClaus doll... aquarium was another ridiculus subject also.<br/> <br/>What I do not understand is why people does not like shadows in pictures, why they want to see all the details?<br/>Anyway, I think this picture shows how difficult is setup properly the white balance and exposition when You use different sources of light...<br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments, I got also a nice time laughing  with them :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ok, maybe this picture deserve some explanation :)The relation with the challenge "school days" is the graduation hat, can You see it? I wanted to make some funny point about graduation, after studying 20 years of your life something You end up working in something totally different... I feel graduation events at schools are like clowns in circus... I did not have a clown at home but I had something similar: my SantaClaus doll... aquarium was another ridiculus subject also. What I do not understand is why people does not like shadows in pictures, why they want to see all the details?Anyway, I think this picture shows how difficult is setup properly the white balance and exposition when You use different sources of light... Thanks for your comments, I got also a nice time laughing  with them :) ', '2004-10-27 11:51:57.000000', NULL, 0),
