(976795, 113227, 23939, '<td valign="top">Hey that''s me! No its really not. Dude you suck. The photo is very mean and it sucks. Why in the hell would you waste your time putting a border around it because it obviously is just an attempt to hurt someone you low piece of sh*t(fecal matter).</td>', 'Hey that''s me! No its really not. Dude you suck. The photo is very mean and it sucks. Why in the hell would you waste your time putting a border around it because it obviously is just an attempt to hurt someone you low piece of sh*t(fecal matter).', '2004-10-27 18:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
