(976923, 113308, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oh, man! This is <b>the</b> most underrated image in the challenge!! 4.686?!  That''s an outrage. The beautiful subtle shading and smooth, brilliant colors are fantastic. <br/> <br/>I can see only two (bogus, IMO) reasons mentioned in the comments this could deserve to finish less than 6.0 (I gave it a 9, I only very rarely give out 10s): <br/>1) it''s less than the maximum allowable size<br/>2) the image doesn''t SCREAM ''school'' to some people apparently<br/> <br/>I have to say that it''s the best looking 17 KB image I''ve seen here. :)  That said, you may have done a lot better with a image 640px wide, and use all the 150 KB you are allowed. I thought this was fine at this size, but obviously some people got hung up on this point.</td>', 'Oh, man! This is the most underrated image in the challenge!! 4.686?!  That''s an outrage. The beautiful subtle shading and smooth, brilliant colors are fantastic.  I can see only two (bogus, IMO) reasons mentioned in the comments this could deserve to finish less than 6.0 (I gave it a 9, I only very rarely give out 10s): 1) it''s less than the maximum allowable size2) the image doesn''t SCREAM ''school'' to some people apparently I have to say that it''s the best looking 17 KB image I''ve seen here. :)  That said, you may have done a lot better with a image 640px wide, and use all the 150 KB you are allowed. I thought this was fine at this size, but obviously some people got hung up on this point.', '2004-10-27 19:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
