(1010731, 113510, 29440, '<td valign="top">I also do high school football games and I know the problems that a photographer confronts.  Your ISO could be set higher.  Most stadiums do not have the greatest lighting systems for action night photos.  You run into a depth of field problem because of the lighting.  It is challenge to get good action photos. Keep trying as you will learn from your experiences</td>', 'I also do high school football games and I know the problems that a photographer confronts.  Your ISO could be set higher.  Most stadiums do not have the greatest lighting systems for action night photos.  You run into a depth of field problem because of the lighting.  It is challenge to get good action photos. Keep trying as you will learn from your experiences', '2004-11-14 19:05:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1014135, 113864, 29544, '<td valign="top">Well done for being in the right place at the right time. Good photo! But if you set it up, I''ll take my lens cap off to you.</td>', 'Well done for being in the right place at the right time. Good photo! But if you set it up, I''ll take my lens cap off to you.', '2004-11-16 18:23:46.000000', NULL, 0),
