(1547644, 113832, 39144, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture. The use of lines is very effective in leadin the person in to the picture, and the fog in keeping them there. It is also quite pleasing to the eye that the stairway isn''t straight, but very crooked. Exposure is great, especially the excellent use of whites on just the main subject. Well done!</td>', 'Excellent picture. The use of lines is very effective in leadin the person in to the picture, and the fog in keeping them there. It is also quite pleasing to the eye that the stairway isn''t straight, but very crooked. Exposure is great, especially the excellent use of whites on just the main subject. Well done!', '2005-07-19 21:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
