(2413712, 113986, 36628, '<td valign="top">Really well executed shot, although I''m not really a fan of the more flat style of still life. I think this one works well with the lighting and shadowplay, which adds depth. It does feel a little bit on the dark side though, and lightening up some of the lighlights just a little might give it more visual impact.</td>', 'Really well executed shot, although I''m not really a fan of the more flat style of still life. I think this one works well with the lighting and shadowplay, which adds depth. It does feel a little bit on the dark side though, and lightening up some of the lighlights just a little might give it more visual impact.', '2006-05-14 04:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3897646, 113308, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh! If only this were larger, so the viewer could see it better... This is a LOVELY image! The light is so smooth, clean and even. Absolutely beautiful image! Your composition and cropping was perfect, and the colors are vibrant and sweet. Definitely deserved a much higher score!</td>', 'Oh! If only this were larger, so the viewer could see it better... This is a LOVELY image! The light is so smooth, clean and even. Absolutely beautiful image! Your composition and cropping was perfect, and the colors are vibrant and sweet. Definitely deserved a much higher score!', '2007-07-12 13:07:09.000000', NULL, 0),
